<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Guji Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Kitaaba Iyoobii</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kitaaba Iyoobii</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kitaaba Iyoobii</para>
  <para style="toc3">Iyo.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kitaaba Iyoobii</para>
  <para style="imt">Seensa</para>
  <para style="ip">Kitaab Iyoobii dabarsii marroo namicha dansaa rakkoon jaddu'uu fi balaan irra dhaqqabe tokkoo hima. Nami kun ijoollee ifiitii fi qabeenna ifii mara dhabiisa qofa adoo hin te'in, madaa hantu'uun farre. Achiin duuba wolaloo sad ta akka mari'iitiin dhikaatteen Iyoobii fi jaaloti isaa haala farrisiisaa akkanaatiin waan itti dhage'ame mudhisan. Dhuma irratti Waaqi ifiifuu Iyoobitti mudhata.</para>
  <para style="ip">Jaaloti Iyoobii rakkoo isa irra dhaqqadde yaada dhugeeffannaa aada'aatiin diidessan. Tanaaf isaan, «Waaqi nama qajeela'aaf waan dansaa kenna; nama hamaa hin adaba; tanaaf Iyoob cubbuu waan hujeef rakkoon tun isa irra dhaqqadde» jedhan. Iyoob nama balcha'aa fi qajeelaa waan te'eef, adabbiin hantuun tun ammoo ta isa irra dhaqqabu'uuf hin malle. Wonni hiibboo te'e nama balchaa akkasii irratti adabbiin hantuun dhaqqabiisa. Iyoob dhugeeffannaa ifii irraa duubatti deebi'iisa dhabulle, Waaqi muraa sirri'ii isaaf kennee, akka bilisa isa baasuu fi akka duriititti akka isa deebisuuf Waaqa jabeessee gaafatiisa hin lakkinne.</para>
  <para style="ip">Waaqi gaaffii Iyoobiitiif deebii tokko tokkoon kennuu dhabulle, dhugeeffanna'atti jabaatiisa isaa, hunnaa fi qarooma ifii ka adda te'een bifa wolaloo baaseffachiittuun deebii isaaf kenneera. Achiin duuba Iyoob, Waaqi gudda'aa fi qaroo akka te'e hubatee, sodaa male'ee fi dubbii mufi'iitiin waan itti dubbateef gaabbee, araara galeera.</para>
  <para style="ip">Dhuma irratti kutaan barreeffama karaa wolaloo hin te'iniin barreeffame, Iyoob akka duriititti akka deebi'ee fi karralle ta durii caala'aayyuu akka dhaggate hubachiisa. Jaaloti Iyoobii rakkoon isa dhaqqadde sababa maaniitiif akka teete waan hin beekiniif, Waaqi guddoo isaan xixeera. Yaada dhugeeffannaa aada'aatiin caalaa Waaqi guddaa akka te'e ka hubate Iyoob qofaayyu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Haadhoo Dubbi'ii</para>
  <para style="io1">Iyoob karra ifii, maatii ifiitii fi fayyaa ifii dhabe<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 1:10-2:3">1:10—2:3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyoob guyyaa dhalate abaare<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 3:1-26">3:1-26</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Marii qaraa<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 4:1-14:22">4:1—14:22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Marii lammeesso'oo<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 15:1-21:34">15:1—21:34</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Marii sadeesso'oo<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 22:1-26:14">22:1—26:14</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dubbii Iyoobii ta muumme'ee<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 27:1-30:31">27:1—30:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Iyoob balleessaa akka hin qanne mirkaneessee dubbate <char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 31:1-40">31:1-40</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dubbii Eliihuu<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dubbii Mootii Waan Maraa ta qaraa<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 38:1-39:30">38:1—39:30</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Dubbii Mootii Waan Maraa ta lammeesso'ootii fi deebii Iyoobii<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 40:1-42:6">40:1—42:6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Waaqi deebi'ee Iyoob fayyisee, karraa fi maatii isaa eebbise<char style="ior"><ref loc="JOB 42:7-17">42:7-17</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Seexanni Iyoob Ataabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1"/>Nami maqaan isaa «Iyoob» jedhamu ka lafa, «Uzi» jedhantu keessa le'u tokko jiraayyu; inni nama komii hin qanne, qajeelaa, ka Waaqa sodaatuu fi ka waan hantuu irraa fagaate. <verse eid="JOB 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2"/>Inni ilmaan torbaa fi ijoollee durraa sad, <verse eid="JOB 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3"/>hoolee kuma torba, gaala kuma sad, qotiyyoo ximmaadii dhibba shan, harree dhibba shanii fi tajaajiltoota hedduu qabaayyu. Worra gara aduun baatu jiru keessaa dureessi isa gewu hin jiruuyyu.<verse eid="JOB 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4"/>Ilmaan Iyoobii dabaree dabare'een mana mana ifiititti areerti'iif wol waamaniiyyu; obboleeyyan durraa sadiin ta ifiille waansisaa, isaan woliin nyaataa unaniiyyu. <verse eid="JOB 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5"/>Guyyaan areerti'iif wol waamanu dabareen duuba, Iyoob, «Ijoolleen tiyya gadhaa ifii keessatti Waaqa yakkitee, isa arrassiteerti fa'a» jedhee waan yaaduuf, isaan qulqulleessiisaaf ganama ba'aa ka'ee akka laakkossa isaaniititti ciincaa dhikeessaayyu; inni waan kana yennaa mara tolchaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6"/>Gaafa tokko ergantooti Waaqaa, Mootii Waan Maraa dura yennaa dhikaatane, Seexannille isaan woliin dhikaate. <verse eid="JOB 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa, «Ati eessaa dhutte?» jedhee, Seexana gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:7">Seexanni deebisee, «Lafa irra asii fi achi, olii fi gad deddeebi'aa ture» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Seexanaan, «Tajaajilaa kiyya Iyoob hubattee? Biyya lafaa irra nami akka isaa tokkolle hin jiru; inni nama komii hin qanne, nama qajeelaa, nama ana Waaqa sodaatuu fi hantuu irraa ka fagaate» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9"/>Seexanni deebisee, «Iyoob sababa malee si Waaqa sodaataa ree? <verse eid="JOB 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10"/>Ati isaa fi maatii isaa, waan inni qabu duudi'itti dalleya marsitee ijaartee, hujii isaa duudii eebbittee, horii isaalle waan horsiitteefii motii ree? <verse eid="JOB 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11"/>Me harka keeti diriirsiitii waan inni qabu mara balleessi; inni iluma teeti duratti si hin abaara» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Seexanaan, «Guddoo dansa'a; Iyoob quballe'een hin tuqin malee, waan inni qabu mara akka feete godhuu dandeetta» jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 1:12">Achiin duuba Seexanni Mootii Waan Maraa duraa bayee deeme.<verse eid="JOB 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Dhuma Ijoollee Iyoobiitii fi Badii Karra Isaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13"/>Gaafa tokko ilmaan Iyoobiitii fi ijoolleen durraa ta isaa mana obboleessa angaficha ifiititti nyaataa, daadhii woyni'ii uniisatti adoo jiranuu, <verse eid="JOB 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14"/>nami ergame tokko gara Iyoobii dhufee, «Nuuti qotiyyo'oon qotiisatti jirruun, harreeleelle kaloo nu biraa dheediisatti jirtuun, <verse eid="JOB 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15"/>dedhuma namooti Sheeba'aa isaan lolanee, tajaajiltoota shallaaga'aan ijjeesanee, horii dannabanee deemane; na qofattuu jalaa bayee, tana sitti himiisaaf dhufe» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16"/>Adoo ergamaan sun dubbatiisatti jiruu, ergamaan dhibiin dhufee, «Mandiisuun buutee hoole'ee fi tajaajiltoota teeti fixxe; na qofattuu jalaa bayee, tana sitti himiisaaf dhufe» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17"/>Inniin kunille adoo dubbatiisatti jiruu, ergamaan dhibiin dhufee, «Worri Kaldootaa addee saditti qoodamee, dedhuma nu lolee, gaala duudii fudhatee deeme; tajaajiltootalle shallaaga'aan ijjeese; na qofattuu jalaa bayee, tana sitti himiisaaf dhufe» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18"/>Ergamaan kunille adoo dubbatiisatti jiruu, ergamaan dhibiin dhufee, «Ilmaan teetii fi ijoolleen durraa teeti mana obboleessa angafichaatitti nyaataa, daadhii woyni'ii uniisatti jirtuun, <verse eid="JOB 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19"/>dedhuma hobonbolattiin goomolee irraa dhuttee, roga manaa arfanuu dhoottee, manni isaan irratti jigee dhumatane; na qofattuu jalaa bayee, tana sitti himiisaaf dhufe» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob ol ka'ee gaddaan woyaa ifii tarsaasee, mataa haadatee, lafatti gad gombifamee sagadee, <verse eid="JOB 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21"/>«Ani qullaa gadhaa haadha tiyyaatii dhaladhe. Yoo du'ulle qullaa tiyya deebi'ee deema. Mootiin Waan Maraa kenne; inninuu fudhate. Maqaan isaa leellifamuu ti!» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22"/>Tana duudii keessatti Iyoob cubbuu hin hunye; Waaqa irralle'etti hantuu hin dubbanne.<verse eid="JOB 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Seexanni Ammalle Iyoob Ataabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1"/>Gaafa dhibiille ergantooti Waaqaa, Mootii Waan Maraa duratti yennaa dhikaatane, Seexannille isaan woliin dhikaate. <verse eid="JOB 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa, Seexanaan, «Ati eessaa dhutte?» jedhee gaafate.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 2:2">Seexanni deebisee, «Lafa irra asii fi achi, olii fi gad deddeebi'aa ture» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa Seexanaan, «Tajaajilaa kiyya Iyoob hubattee? Biyya lafa irra nami akka isaa tokkolle hin jiru; inni nama komii hin qanne, nama qajeelaa, nama ana Waaqa sodaatuu fi hantuu irraa ka fagaate. Ati akka ani sababa malee isa irratti ka'ee, isa balleessuuf na kakkaatteerta; inni ammoo haga ammaalle addatamummaa ifii eegateera» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4"/>Seexanni deebisee Mootii Waan Maraatiin, «Inni fayya'a, gogaan isaatuu hin tuqanne; nami fayyaa ifiitiif, waan qabu mara hin kenna. <verse eid="JOB 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5"/>Me amma, harka keeti diriirsiitii lafee isaatii fi foon isaa miidhi; inni fuula duratti si abaara» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6"/>Maarre Mootiin Waan Maraa Seexanaan, «Guddoo dansa'a, lubbuu isaa hin ijjeesin malee, akka feete isa godhuu dandeetta» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7"/>Achiin duuba Seexanni fuula Mootii Waan Maraa duraa bayee deemee, faana miilaa irraa haga gubbaa mata'aatitti madaa hantuu Iyoobitti buuse. <verse eid="JOB 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob ifi hooqatiisaaf bassoo fudhatee, daadhaa keessaa tee'e. <verse eid="JOB 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9"/>Niitiin isaa, «Ati ammalle addatamummaa teeti qabattee jirtaa? Waaqa abaariitii du'i!» jette.<verse eid="JOB 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10"/>Iyoob ammoo isi'iin, «Ati akkuma dubartiin gowwaan dubbattu dubbataarta; Waaqi waan dansaa yennaa nuu kennu gammadaan fudhanna; hantuulle hin fudhannuu ree?» jedhe; tana duudii keessatti Iyoob cubbuu hin hunye; hantuulle hin dubbanne.<verse eid="JOB 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Jaalota Iyoobii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11"/>Jaaloti Iyoobii sadiin, Eliifaaz nami qachaa Temaanii, Beldaad nami lafa Shu'aahiitii fi Zofaariin nami lafa Naa'imaa waan hamaa Iyoob irra geye kana yennaa dhage'ane, isa woliin gaddiisaa fi isa jajjabeessiisaaf, wolii galanee addee jiranu irraa gara isaa dhufane. <verse eid="JOB 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12"/>Isaan fago'otti Iyoob yennaa dhaggane, isa te'uu isaa hubatuu hin dandeenne; eega hubataneen duuba gaddanee woyaa ifii tatarsaasanee, bukuu mataa ifii irra gara ol-gubba'aa bittinneessanee, qoonqoo guddo'oon bowane. <verse eid="JOB 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13"/>Isaan guyyaa torbaa fi halkan torba isa woliin lafa irra tee'ane; rakkoon isaa guddoo akka teete waan dhagganeef, isaan keessaa nami tokkolle wo isatti hin dubbanne.<verse eid="JOB 2:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob Guyyaa Itti Dhalate Abaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1"/>Tanaan duuba Iyoob dubbatiisa jalqabe; inni guyyaa itti dhalate abaaree,<verse eid="JOB 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2-3"/>«Halkan ani itti dadame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:2-3">guyyaan ani itti dhaladhelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:2-3">ka abaarame te'uu ti!<verse eid="JOB 3:2-3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4"/>Guyyaan sun gara dukkanaa jijjiiramuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">Waaqi ol-gubba'aa isa hin yaadatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:4">ifille isa irratti hin ifin.<verse eid="JOB 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5"/>Dimimmisaa fi dukkanti dimmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">‹Ati keenna› isaan jedhanuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:5">Duumensi isa irratti bu'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:5">dukkanti ifa isaa gollituu ti.<verse eid="JOB 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6"/>Halkan san dukkanti dimmi gollituu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">guyyoota wogga'aa keessatti hin laakkowamin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:6">laakkossa ji'aalle'etti hin galin.<verse eid="JOB 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7"/>Halkan sun maseena te'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:7">ililleettiille hin dhage'amin.<verse eid="JOB 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8"/>Worri guyyaa abaaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">bineensa naacha fakkaatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">ka, ‹Lewaataan› jedhamu kakkaasiisaaf qophowelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:8">halkan san abaaruu ti.<verse eid="JOB 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9"/>Bakkalchi bari'ii ka halkan sanii dukkanoottuu ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:9">Halkan sun addi'iin ifa eegatuu ti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">ammoo hin dhaggatin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:9">boruulle hin dayya'iniif.<verse eid="JOB 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10"/>Guyyaan sun rakkinna ila tiyya duraa dhossiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">balbala gadaamessa haadha tiyyaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:10">waan hin cufiniif ka abaarame te'uu ti.<verse eid="JOB 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11"/>«Ani maaf gadaamessa haadha tiyyaa keessatti hin du'in?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:11">Gadaamessa keessaa yennaa bayelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:11">maaf hin badin?<verse eid="JOB 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12"/>Haati tiyya maaf gudeeda ifii irra keyatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:12">Harma ifiille maaf na hoositte?<verse eid="JOB 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13"/>Sila amma nageyaan irkadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:13">rafee hin foorfadhaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14"/>Moototaa fi gorsitoota lafaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">worra addee ifiif ijaarratanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:14">isaan duraa diigante woliin,<verse eid="JOB 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15"/>sooreyyii gugurdoo worra worqi'ii fi meeti'iin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:15">mana ifii guutatane woliin sila hin foorfadhaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16"/>Yookiin ani maaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">akka finna du'ee dhalatee awwaalamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:16">ka ijjumaa ifa hin dhagginii hin te'in?<verse eid="JOB 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17"/>Awwaala keessatti worri hamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">hammeenna ifii hin lakkisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:17">ka dadhabanelle achitti hin foorfatan.<verse eid="JOB 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18"/>Worri booji'ame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">achitti nageya dhaggatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:18">qoonqoo worra hunnaan isaan hujisiisuulle hin dhage'anu.<verse eid="JOB 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19"/>«Worri didiqqa'aa fi gugurdaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">addee takka'atti dhaggaman.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 3:19">Garbootille goottota ifii jalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:19">achitti bilisa hin bayan.<verse eid="JOB 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20"/>Worra rakkoo hantuu keessa jiruuf ifi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">worra le'iin itti hadhootteef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:20">jiruun maaf kennanti?<verse eid="JOB 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21"/>Worra du'a halchee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">ka karra dhoffante qotee barbaadu caalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">ka du'a barbaaduuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:21">jiruun maaf kennantii?<verse eid="JOB 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22"/>Worra awwaala bira yennaa gewu ilillisuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:22">jiruun maaf kennanti?<verse eid="JOB 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23"/>Nama karaan duraa dhoffameef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">ka Waaqi karaa itti cufeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:23">ifi maaf kennamaaf?<verse eid="JOB 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24"/>Gaddi kiyya akkuma sagale'ee naaf dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:24">aadiis kiyya akkuma bisaanii dhangala'a.<verse eid="JOB 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25"/>Wonni ani sodaadhe natti dhutte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:25">wonni na naasiselle na irratti te'e.<verse eid="JOB 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26"/>Ani raafama malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">nageyaa hin qabu, miira hin qabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 3:26">fooralle hin qabu» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 3:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Eliifaaz Iyoobitti Dubbate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1"/>Achiin duuba Eliifaaziin nami qachaa Temaanii deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2"/>«Iyoob, yoo nami si woliin dubbatiisaaf sitti game</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">hin ossattuu ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:2">Ammoo eentu dubbatuu lakkisaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3"/>Ati namoota hedduu barsiitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:3">worra dadhabaa harka qaddee jajjabeessiteerta.<verse eid="JOB 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4"/>Dubbiin teeti worra jigu utuddeerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:4">worra jilbi isaanii laafelle jabeessiteerta.<verse eid="JOB 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5"/>Amma ammoo rakkoon sitti dhuttee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">addii kutatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">waan sitti jabaattelle'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:5">jajjabeenna dhaddeerta.<verse eid="JOB 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6"/>Waaqa sodaatiis keeti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">isatti addatiisa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">qajeelummaan teetille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:6">addii teetii motiiyyuu ree?<verse eid="JOB 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7"/>«Me yaadadhu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">nami balleessaa hin qanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:7">yookiin nami balchaan badee beekaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8"/>Akka ani dhaggetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">worri waan hantuu qotuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">rakkinna facaasu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:8">waanuma san haammata.<verse eid="JOB 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9"/>Isaan hafuura Waaqi isaanitti baafatuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:9">qilleensa aarii isaatille'een hin dhumatan.<verse eid="JOB 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10"/>Worri hamaan akka neenqaa dhangaa dhowa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">qoonqoolle ol qabatee iyya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:10">Waaqi ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:10">ilkaan isaanii hin caccassa.<verse eid="JOB 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11"/>Akkuma neenqa waan adansee nyaatu dhabee du'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">isaanille hin du'an.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:11">Akkuma ilmeen neenqa dhala'aa bittinnoottu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:11">ijoolleen isaaniille hin bittinnootti.<verse eid="JOB 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12"/>«Gaafa tokko ergaan takka gara kiyya dhuttee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:12">gurri kiyyalle hasaassaa san dhage'e.<verse eid="JOB 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13"/>Halkan yennaa kolbaan hirriiba hamaa keessa jirtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:13">ani mudhii na sodaachittu dhaggee,<verse eid="JOB 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14"/>sodaadhee bararaqee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:14">lafeen tiyya duudiin hollatte.<verse eid="JOB 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15"/>Qilleensi fuula na dhowee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:15">nafi kiyya suugajjaye.<verse eid="JOB 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16"/>Achitti wonni takka dhaabbattuun dhagge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">ammoo maan akka teete beekuu hin dandeenne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 4:16">Achiin duuba cadheessa keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:16">qoonqoo takka:<verse eid="JOB 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17"/>‹Waaqa caalaa nami balchaa te'uu dande'aa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">Yookiin ka isa dade duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:17">qulqulluu te'uu dande'aa?<verse eid="JOB 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18"/>Waaqi tajaajiltoota ifiituu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ka hin addanne eega teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:18">ergantoota ifii ta ol-gubba'aa irralle'etti dokonkora ka dhaggu eega teete,<verse eid="JOB 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19"/>worra mana biyyee faaraa irraa hujamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ta hundeen isaa biyyee keessa jirtu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">ka adoo qu'een hin nyaatin caccabu keessa le'anutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:19">attam addata ree?<verse eid="JOB 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20"/>Isaan ganamaa haga galgalaatitti hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">adoo nami itti hin yaadatin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:20">haga bara baraa hin badan.<verse eid="JOB 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21"/>Isaan akka dongoraa dunkaani'ii ka buqa'uu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 4:21">qarooma malee hin du'an› jettu dhage'e.<verse eid="JOB 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1"/>«Iyoob! Nama deebii siif kennu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">yoo dhaggatte waami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">woyyoota<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Woyyoota: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isaan kun ergantoota Waaqaa ti.</char></note> keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:1">gara kamii ilaalta?<verse eid="JOB 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2"/>Nama gowwaa aari'iittuu ijjeesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:2">wollaalaalle gaabbi'ittuu ijjeesa.<verse eid="JOB 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3"/>Gowwaan hidda naqatuun dhaggeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:3">ammoo dedhuma manni isaa abaarame<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:3 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Abaarame: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin diigame.</char></note>.<verse eid="JOB 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4"/>Ijoolleen isaa ijjumaa nageya hin dhaggattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">badhinna dalleya keessaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">miidhaan isaan irra hin geetti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:4">nami isaan baasulle hin jiraatu.<verse eid="JOB 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5"/>Worri beelowe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">midhaan isaa hin nyaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">ka qoree keessatti latelle hin lakkisanuuf.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 5:5">Worri dheebote</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:5">qabeenna isaa hin saama.<verse eid="JOB 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6"/>Rakkoon biyyee keessaa ol hin baatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:6">gaargalli lafa irraa hin latu.<verse eid="JOB 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7"/>Akkuma qaanqeen ibiddaa ol facaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:7">nami rakkinnaaf dhalata.<verse eid="JOB 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8"/>«Adoo na te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">Waaqa hin barbaadadha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:8">rakkoo tiyyalle isatti hin himadha.<verse eid="JOB 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9"/>Inni waan gugurda'aa hin qorqoranne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:9">bilbaasa laakkowanee hin dandeennelle hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10"/>Inni lafa irratti bokkeya hin roobisiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:10">fichaalle bisaan hin obaasa.<verse eid="JOB 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11"/>Worra gad qabame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">addee ulfinnaa hin keya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:11">worra gadde addee nageyaatitti ol hin fuudha.<verse eid="JOB 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12"/>Worri maltooleen waan hujanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">akka hin muummessineef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:12">inni karoora isaanii hin gufachiisa.<verse eid="JOB 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13"/>Inni qaroolee maltummaa isaaniitiinuu qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:13">mala maltoole'eelle hin balleessa.<verse eid="JOB 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14"/>Guyyaan isaanitti dukkanowee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">akka halkaniititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:14">saafowaan qaqqabataa deemanuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15"/>Worra hiyyeeyyii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">afaan shallaagaa diina isaanii jalaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:15">harka worra isaan cunqursuu jalalle'ee hin baasa.<verse eid="JOB 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16"/>Inni hiyyeeyyi'iif addii hin kenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:16">afaan worra hama'aa hin cufa.<verse eid="JOB 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17"/>«Nami Waaqi xixu ka gammade!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">Tanaaf xixicha Waaqa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:17">waan mara dande'uu hin tuffatin.<verse eid="JOB 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18"/>Waaqi hin madeessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">ammoo deebisee hin hodha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">inni si hin miidha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:18">harka ifiitiin ammoo si hin fayyisa.<verse eid="JOB 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19"/>Inni balaa jaa jalaa si hin baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:19">torbeessoo irralle'etti miidham si hin tuqu.<verse eid="JOB 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20"/>Bara beelaa du'a irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:20">lola keessatti shallaagaa irraa si hin woda.<verse eid="JOB 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21"/>Waaqi arraba hamaa irraa si hin eega;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:21">yoo badiin sitti dhuttelle hin sodaattu.<verse eid="JOB 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22"/>Badi'ii fi beelatti hin kollita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:22">bineensalle hin sodaattu.<verse eid="JOB 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23"/>Fichaa qotattutti dhakaan si hin rakkisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:23">bineensotille si woliin nageya hin qabaatan.<verse eid="JOB 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24"/>Dunkaaniin teeti nageyaan akka jirtu hin beetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">yennaa hoolee teeti toowattu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:24">nageyaan isaan hin dhaggita.<verse eid="JOB 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25"/>Sanyiin teeti hedduu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">ijoolleen teetille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:25">akka marra lafaa akka teetu hin beetta.<verse eid="JOB 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26"/>Akkuma qamadiin yennaa ifiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">wolitti qabantu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:26">atille dulloontee, geettee hin duuta.<verse eid="JOB 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27"/>«Kunoo, nuuti tana duudii qorqorreerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">tun dhuga'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 5:27">atille dhage'iitii beeki» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 5:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob Deebii Kenne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2"/>«Farri tiyya adoo madaalantee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">gaargalli kiyya duudiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:2">madaallii irra adoo keyamee jiraatee,<verse eid="JOB 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3"/>maansa irga abbaaya'aa caalaa ulfaataayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">tanaaf jarjariisaan dubbatiis kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:3">si hin baaseffachiittu.<verse eid="JOB 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4"/>Waaqi waan mara dande'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">daaya ifiitiin na woraanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">hadhaan isaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:4">nafa keessa na faca'eera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:4">Bararaqiisi Waaqaa na marseera.<verse eid="JOB 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5"/>Harreen diidaa yennaa marra dheeddu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">Yookiin qotiyyoon yennaa okeya nyaattu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:5">hin baroodii ree?<verse eid="JOB 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6"/>Sagalee hin mi'oonne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">soodda malee nyaatanii ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:6">Yookiin bisaan quupha'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:6">hin mi'owaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7"/>Ani sagalee akkasii tuqiisalle hin jibba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:7">yoo nyaadhelle akka dhibamu na gooti.<verse eid="JOB 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8"/>«Maaloo waan gaafadhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">adoo dhaggadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">Waaqi halchaa tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:8">adoo naaf guutee!<verse eid="JOB 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9"/>Fedha isaa teetee adoo na caccassee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:9">harka ifii diriirsee adoo na balleessee,<verse eid="JOB 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10"/>tun silaa naaf jajjabeenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:10">Ani jecha Waaqa woyyichaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">waan hin mormatiniif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">dhibeen natti fakkantulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:10">ani silaa gammadaan hin utaalaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11"/>«Jiru'uun le'iisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">jabeenna maan qaba ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:11">Eega addii hin qabaatinii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:11">maaf le'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12"/>Jabeenni kiyya jabeenna dhaka'aatii ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:12">Foon kiyya sageettu'uu ree?<verse eid="JOB 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13"/>Dhugumaan ifi qarqaariisaaf hunna hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:13">hunni tiyya duudiin na irraa fudhatanteerti.<verse eid="JOB 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14"/>«Nami jaala ifii ka rakkatteef marartii dhabu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:14">Waaqa waan mara dande'u sodaatiisa lakkiseera.<verse eid="JOB 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15"/>Isin obboleeyyan tiyya ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">akka laga yennaa roobi hin jirree goguu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:15">na soddane.<verse eid="JOB 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16"/>Lagi sun ji'a gannaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:16">dhakaa roobaatiin guutama.<verse eid="JOB 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17"/>Yennaa o'aa ammoo lagi sun hin dhabama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:17">yennaa bonaa hin goga.<verse eid="JOB 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18"/>Daldaltooti bisaan barbaadata karaa irraa miliqanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:18">goomolee keessa daaqaa badan.<verse eid="JOB 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19"/>Daldaltooti Teema'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">bisaan hin barbaadatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">daldaltooti Sheebaalle bisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:19">dhaggatiisaaf addii godhatan.<verse eid="JOB 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20"/>Lagi isaan addatanu waan gogeef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">addii hin kutatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">addee san yennaa geyanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:20">hin bilinjoyan.<verse eid="JOB 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21"/>Isinille akkuma laga goge sanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">natti teetane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:21">farra tiyya dhaggitanee sodaattane.<verse eid="JOB 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22"/>Ani ‹Woy naaf kenna'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:22">Karra teessaniin na woda'a!<verse eid="JOB 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23"/>Yookiin harka diinaa jalaa na baasa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">yookiin harka worra na cunqursuu jalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:23">na woda'a!› jedheeraa?<verse eid="JOB 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24"/>«Ani hin cadhisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">isin na barsiisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:24">dokonkora kiyyalle natti hima'a.<verse eid="JOB 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25"/>Dubbiin dhuga'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:25">attam attam hunnaametti'i!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:25">Komiin teessan ammoo bu'aa hin qaddu.<verse eid="JOB 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26"/>Isin dubbii tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">sirreessuu barbaaddanii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:26">Dubbii ana nama addii kutateelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:26">akka qilleensaatitti laakkottanii ree?<verse eid="JOB 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27"/>Ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qanne irratti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">hixaa buufattan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:27">jaalota teessanille gurguriisaaf gadhassiittan.<verse eid="JOB 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28"/>«Amma ammoo, maganne'ee gara kiyya ilaala'a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 6:28">Ani fuula keessan duratti dhara hin dubbadhaa?<verse eid="JOB 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29"/>Deebi'a'a; worra muraa dharaa muru hin te'ina'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">ammalle deebi'a'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:29">ani dhugaa irra jira.<verse eid="JOB 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30"/>Arraba kiyya irra dokonkorri hin jiraa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">afaan kiyya waan hantuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 6:30">addaan baasuu hin dande'uu ree?<verse eid="JOB 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1"/>«Nami elo'oon lafa irra jiraataa motii?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:1">Barri isaalle akka bara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:1">nama qaxaramee hujuutii motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2"/>Akka garboolee gaaddisa jala foorfatiisa barbaadanuutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:2">akka hojjatoota mindaa ifii eegatanuutii mootii?<verse eid="JOB 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3"/>Ji'ooti elo'oo naaf ka bu'aa hin qanne te'ane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">halkan farraalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:3">naaf kennamane.<verse eid="JOB 7:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4"/>Yennaa rafu ‹Yoom dammaqa?› jedhaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">halkan natti dheeratee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">haga bariitutti asii fi achi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:4">gara gaggala.<verse eid="JOB 7:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5"/>Nafi kiyya duudiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">corroqoyee qonyonyaayeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:5">babbaqaqeelle maloweera.<verse eid="JOB 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6"/>«Barri kiyya mooqaa harfa'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mooqaa harfa'aa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mooqaan harfa'aa kun ka worri woyaa dhowu suqaa keessa keyee gamaa fi gamanatti qolaanfatu.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">caalaa ariifata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:6">addii maleelle dhumata.<verse eid="JOB 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7"/>Ee Waaqa, jiruun tiyya akka hafuura baafatiisaa fi fudhatiisaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:7">ilti tiyya deebitee waan dansaa hin dhaggitu.<verse eid="JOB 7:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8"/>Ilti amma na dhaggitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">deebitee na hin dhaggitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:8">ati na hin barbaadda ani ammoo hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9"/>Akkuma duumensi bittinnowee badu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:9">nami du'ee awwaalamu deebi'ee hin ka'u.<verse eid="JOB 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10"/>Lammoo gara mana ifii hin deebi'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:10">worri isa beeku duudiin isa hin dedha.<verse eid="JOB 7:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11"/>«Tanaaf ani hin cadhisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">laalaa ayyaana kiyyaa hin dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:11">hadhaa lubbuu tiyyaa irraa ta kaate hin gunguma.<verse eid="JOB 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12"/>Ati akka na eeganuuf ka goote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:12">ani abbaaya'a moo bineensa guddaa abbaaya'aa ti?<verse eid="JOB 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13"/>Taqeen tiyya na jajjabeessiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">addeen ani rafu dhibee tiyya irraa goonsiti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:13">yennaa jedhu,<verse eid="JOB 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14"/>ati ammoo oojju'uun na sodaachitta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:14">mudhille'een na bararassita.<verse eid="JOB 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15"/>Jiruu farraa tanaa mannaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">suruurraa ifitti dhowee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:15">du'u naaf woyya.<verse eid="JOB 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16"/>Ani jiruu tiyya jibbeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">haga bara baraa le'iisa hin barbaadu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">barri jiruu tiyyaa gabaabaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gabaabaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">baafata hafuuraa tokko </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedha.</char></note> waan te'eef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:16">na lakkis.<verse eid="JOB 7:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17"/>«Akka nama barbaachisaa te'e tokkootitti akka isa ilaaltuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:17">akka guddoo isa yaadattuufille nami maan inni?<verse eid="JOB 7:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18"/>Ati ganama ganama isa hin ilaalta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:18">yennaa mara isa hin qorqorta.<verse eid="JOB 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19"/>Haguma hancufa liqinsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:19">ila ana irra hin deebifattuu?<verse eid="JOB 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20"/>Waaqa namoota eeddu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">ani yoo cubbuu huje maan si godhe?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:20">Maaf waan itti xiyyeeffattu na godhatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:20">Ani hagana mara ba'aa sitti te'ee?<verse eid="JOB 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21"/>Ati maaf balleessaa tiyya naaf hin araaramin?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">Maaf yakkaa tiyya ana irraa hin balleessin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 7:21">Ani amma waan awwaalamuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ati na hin barbaadda,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 7:21">ani ammoo hin jiru» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 7:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Biildaad</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1"/>Achiin duuba Biildaad nami biyya Shu'aa deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 8:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2"/>«Haga yoomii dubbii akkasii dubbatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">Dubbiin afaan keetii baatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:2">akka qilleensaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3"/>Waaqi muraa hin dassaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">Yookiin Waaqi waan mara dande'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:3">dhugaa hin dassaa?<verse eid="JOB 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4"/>Ijoolleen teeti yoo Waaqa yakkitee jiraattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">inni adabbii cubbuu isaaniitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:4">dabarsee isaan kenne.<verse eid="JOB 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5"/>Ati ammoo yoo Waaqa barbaaddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:5">Waaqa waan mara dande'ulle yoo gaafatte,<verse eid="JOB 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6"/>ati qullu'uu fi qajeelaa yoo teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">inni dhugumaan si qarqaariisaaf hin ka'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">gara addee teetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:6">ta si'iif maltetti si hin deebisa.<verse eid="JOB 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7"/>Jalqabi keeti diqqaa te'ulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:7">muummee irratti hin banqaaxxa.<verse eid="JOB 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8"/>«Me dhaloota durii gaafadhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:8">waan abbootiin isaanii qorqoranee dhagganelle qalbeeffadhu.<verse eid="JOB 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9"/>Nuuti kalee waan dhalanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">womaalle hin beennu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:9">Barri keenna ka biyya lafaa irraalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:9">akka gaaddisaa dabara.<verse eid="JOB 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10"/>Wonni isaan si barsiisanuu fi sitti himanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:10">waan hubataneeranuu motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11"/>Allaaduun addee caffaan hin jirretti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">latuu dandeettii ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:11">Addee bisaan hin jirretti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:11">shonbooqqoon hin banqaaxxii ree?<verse eid="JOB 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12"/>Adoo kichu'uutuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">adoo hin muramin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:12">biqiltoota dhibi'iin dura hin qooran.<verse eid="JOB 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13"/>Worri Waaqa dedhu duudiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">akkasuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:13">addiin nama Waaqa malee le'uu hin baddi.<verse eid="JOB 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14"/>Inni waan akka kaso'otti citutti addata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:14">addiin isaalle mana saaphuphu'uu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Saaphuphuu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Worri tokko tokko baatti-baarree jedhan.</char></note> ti.<verse eid="JOB 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15"/>Nami tokko mana saaphuphu'uutitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">yoo irkate, manni sun hin dhaabbatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 8:15">Inni mana san yoo qabate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:15">isa duraa hin cita.<verse eid="JOB 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16"/>Nami hamaan akka biqiltuu aduu keessatti dagaaguu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:16">dameen isaa oorruu gubbaa babadhata.<verse eid="JOB 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17"/>Hiddi isaa tuulaa dhaka'aatitti marata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:17">odduu rassa'aa keessalle karaa barbaadata.<verse eid="JOB 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18"/>Nami tokko addee isaa irraa yoo isa buqqise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">addeen sun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">‹Ani si dhaggee hin beeku›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:18">jettee isa hin mormatti.<verse eid="JOB 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19"/>Kunoo, gammadi jiruu hidda sanii kanuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:19">biqiltuun dhibiin lafa san keessaa hin latan.<verse eid="JOB 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20"/>«Waaqi worra komii hin qanne hin gatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:20">yookiin worra hantuu huju hin qarqaaru.<verse eid="JOB 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21"/>Inni akka ati kollituu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:21">ilillittu si hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22"/>Worri si jibbu qaanii uffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 8:22">dunkaaniin worra hama'aa hin baddi» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2"/>«Dhuguma tun dhugaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">akka teete hin beeka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:2">Ammoo nami attam Waaqa duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:2">balchaa te'uu dande'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3"/>Nami tokko Waaqaan falmuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">yoo barbaade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">gaaffii kuma keessaa takkattiille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:3">deebisee hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4"/>Waaqi qaro'o; hunnaamessalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">ka isa moromee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:4">hin injifatamin eennuu?<verse eid="JOB 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5"/>Inni dedhuma gaara tatachoosee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:5">aarii ifiitiin isaan hin balleessa.<verse eid="JOB 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6"/>Waaqi lafa addee isi'ii irraa hin tachoosa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:6">utuboota lafaalle hin raasa.<verse eid="JOB 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7"/>Inni aduun akka hin baane hin ajaja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:7">urjootille ifa akka hin kennine hin dhoogga.<verse eid="JOB 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8"/>Inni qofuu ol-gubbaa diriirse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:8">danbalii bisaanii irralle hin ideema.<verse eid="JOB 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9"/>Tuuta urjootaa ka bineensa, ‹Doobbaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Doobbaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bineensa Iyyaa fakkaatu.</char></note>› jedhamu fakkaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">tuuta urjootaa ka, ‹Sadee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sadee: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiikkaan gariin Ooriyoon jedhan.</char></note>› jedhamu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">tuuta urjootaa ka, ‹Torbii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Torbii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiikkaan gariin Piliyaadis jedhan.</char></note>› jedhamuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:9">tuuta urjoota gara kibbaalle isatti dade.<verse eid="JOB 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10"/>Waan maade'ee ta qorqoranee bira hin geenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:10">bilbaasota laakkonnee hin dhaqqanne hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11"/>Yennaa inni na biraan dabaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">ani isa hin dhaggu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">yennaa inni cinaa tiyya ideemu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:11">ani isa hin hubadhu.<verse eid="JOB 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12"/>Yoo inni butee ideeme,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:12">eentu isa dhoogga?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:12">Eentu isaan, ‹Ati maan godhiisatti jirta?› jedha.<verse eid="JOB 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13"/>Waaqi mufii ifii duubatti hin deebisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">worri bineensa guddaa abbaayaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:13">ka, ‹Rahaab› jedhamu qarqaaruuyyuu isaaf hin sagadan.<verse eid="JOB 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14"/>«Ani attam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">deebii isaaf kennuu dande'a ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:14">Ani isa woliin falmiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:14">attamiin jechoota filatuu dande'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15"/>Ani yakkaa qabaatuu yoo dhabelle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">abbaa mura'aa kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">akka naaf mararu gaafadha malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:15">deebii isaaf kennuu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16"/>Ani maqaa isaa waammadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">inni naaf yoo deebiselle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:16">akka inni qoonqoo tiyya dhage'u hin dhugeeffadhu.<verse eid="JOB 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17"/>Inni bubbe'een na butucha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:17">sababa malee madaa natti baceessa.<verse eid="JOB 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18"/>Inni hadha'aan na guuta malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:18">hafuura na hin fudhachiisu.<verse eid="JOB 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19"/>Marroo jabeennaa yoo teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">inni jaba'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:19">Marroo mura'aa yoo teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">gara addee mura'aa san</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:19">ka isa waamuu dande'u eennu?<verse eid="JOB 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20"/>Ani yakkaa qabaatuu dhabulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">afaan kiyyaayyuu natti mura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">ani ka komii hin qanne te'ulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:20">‹Daba'a› anaan jedha.<verse eid="JOB 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21"/>«Ani ka komii hin qanne te'ulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">marroo mataa kiyyaa hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:21">jiruu tiyyalle hin jibba.<verse eid="JOB 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22"/>Martinuu tokkuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">tanaaf ani, ‹Waaqi worra komii hin qannee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:22">worra hamaaleyyii hin balleessa› jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23"/>Yennaa balaan nama yakkaa hin qanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">dedhuma ijjeesu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:23">Waaqi isatti hin qacifata.<verse eid="JOB 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24"/>Yennaa latti harka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">worra hamaaleyyi'iititti kennantu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">Waaqi ila abbootii mura'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">ta lafa sanii hin golla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 9:24">Isa yoo hin te'in,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:24">tana ka godhe eennu ree?<verse eid="JOB 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25"/>«Barri kiyya nama rukkisu caalaa ariifata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:25">adoo waan dansaa hin dhagginuu dabara.<verse eid="JOB 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26"/>Akka hoboloo ariifattu'uu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Akka hoboloo ariifattu'uu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hoboloon allaaduu irraa hujante waan ariifattuuf, hiikkaan gariin akka hoboloo allaadu'uu jedhan.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:26">akka risaa waan nyaatu butatiisaaf irii gad xinniquu dabara.<verse eid="JOB 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27"/>Ani, ‹Gungunsuu tiyya hin dedha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">nyaara guuruu lakkisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:27">hin seeqadha› yoo jedhe,<verse eid="JOB 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28"/>akka nama yakkaa hin qanneetitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">akka ati na hin ilaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">waan beekuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:28">farra tiyya duudii hin sodaadha.<verse eid="JOB 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29"/>Yakkaan eega natti murantu teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:29">maaf toluma dadhaba ree?<verse eid="JOB 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30"/>Nafa kiyya saamunaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">harka kiyya haraanja'aan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:30">yoo dhiqadhelle,<verse eid="JOB 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31"/>ati boolla haraa itti gatanu keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">na gatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:31">woyaan tiyyaayyuu na jibbiti.<verse eid="JOB 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32"/>«Ani isa woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">gara kora mura'aa dhaqee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">deebii isaaf kenniisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:32">inni akka kiyya nama foon uffatee moti.<verse eid="JOB 9:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33"/>Nami anaa fi Waaqa wolitti araarsiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">wodhakkaa teennatti murtee kennu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:33">adoo hin jiraatuu!<verse eid="JOB 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34"/>Akka ani hin bararandheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:34">adoo Waaqi na adabuu dhabe,<verse eid="JOB 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35"/>ani sodaa malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">silaa isa woliin hin dubbadhaayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 9:35">amma ammoo dubbatuu hin dandeenne.<verse eid="JOB 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1"/>«Ani jiruu tiyya jibbeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">tanaaf ittuma gungumaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:1">hadhaa lubbuu tiyyaa hin dubbadha.<verse eid="JOB 10:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2"/>Ani Waaqaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">‹Waan na loltuuf natti himi malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:2">natti hin murin!<verse eid="JOB 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3"/>Mala worra hamoole'ee fudhattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">hujii harka keetii tuffattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:3">na cunqursiisi si hin gammachiisaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4"/>Ati ila nama foonii qaddaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:4">Akkuma nami ilaalu ilaaltaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5"/>Guyyooti keeti akka guyyoota namaatii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:5">Yookiin woggooti keeti akka woggoota namaatii ree?<verse eid="JOB 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6"/>Ati maaf yakkaa tiyya barbaaddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:6">cubbuu tiyya qorqorta?<verse eid="JOB 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7"/>Akka ani yakkaa hin qannee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">harka keeti keessaa nami na baasu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:7">akka hin jirre ati hin beetta.<verse eid="JOB 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8"/>«‹Ka miidhassee na dade harka keeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:8">amma deebitee na balleessitaa?<verse eid="JOB 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9"/>Faara irraa akka na dadde qaabadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:9">ammalle biyye'etti na deebisu'uufii ree?<verse eid="JOB 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10"/>Ati akka aananii na dhangalaattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:10">akka itittu'uu na hin itichinee ree?<verse eid="JOB 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11"/>Goga'aa fi foon natti uffittee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:11">lafe'ee fi ribu'uun wolitti qassiitte.<verse eid="JOB 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12"/>Ati jiru'uu fi jaalala bara baraa keeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">naaf kenniteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">eeddoon teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:12">na jiraachitteerti.<verse eid="JOB 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13"/>Ati ada waan kana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">gadhaa keeti keessatti dhoffatteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:13">Kun karoora keeti akka te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:13">ani hin beeka.<verse eid="JOB 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14"/>Ani yoo cubbuu huje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">ati hin dhaggita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">yakkaa tiyyalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:14">adaddu malee hin lakkittu.<verse eid="JOB 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15"/>Hamaalessa yoo te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">naaf aanne'e!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Nama balchaa te'ulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">dande'ee mataa kiyya ol hin qabadhu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:15">Ani waan salphadheef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:15">rakko'oon guutameera.<verse eid="JOB 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16"/>Yoo mataa kiyya ol qabadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">ati akka neenqaa na adansita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:16">Na miidhiisaafille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">itti deddeebitee hunna teeti sodaachittuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:16">natti mudhitta.<verse eid="JOB 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17"/>Ati dhugaa baatota haareya na irratti kaatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">mufii teeti natti fakkansita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:17">loltoota haareya natti fidda.<verse eid="JOB 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18"/>«‹Waaqa kiyya, maaf akka ani dhaladhu na goote?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 10:18">Ilti nama tokkoolle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">adoo na hin dhaggin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:18">adoo du'ee hin jiraadhuu!<verse eid="JOB 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19"/>Adoo dhalatiisa hin dhabuu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">Yookiin gadaamessa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:19">gara awwaalaa adoo hin geeffamuu!<verse eid="JOB 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20"/>Barri jiruu tiyyaa gabaaba'aa motii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">Bara gabaabaa kana keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:20">diqqumalle akka gammadu na lakkis.<verse eid="JOB 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21"/>Ani gara lafa deebi'anee hin gallee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:21">lafa dimimmisaatii fi dukkana dimmaa,<verse eid="JOB 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22"/>gara lafa dukkana dimmaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">gara lafa gaaddisa du'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">gara lafa nageya hin qannee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">addee ifi akka dukkanaa te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">adoo hin dhaqin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 10:22">diqqumalle akka gammadu na lakkis› hin jedha» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 10:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Zofaar</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1"/>Achiin duuba Naa'imaatichi Zofaar deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2"/>«Dubbii hedduu tanaaf deebiin hin kennantuu ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:2">Nami dubbatticha te'eef dhugaa dhaggataa ree?<verse eid="JOB 11:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3"/>Iyoob, dharti teeti nama cadhisiittii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">Yennaa ati murgitulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:3">nami si xixu hin jiru seetaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4"/>Ati Waaqaan, ‹Barsiisi kiyya sirri'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">fuula Waaqaa duralle'etti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:4">ani qulqullu'u› jetta.<verse eid="JOB 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5"/>Ammoo adoo Waaqi afaan ifii saaqatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:5">sitti dubbate,<verse eid="JOB 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6"/>karaan qarumma'aa hedduu waan te'eef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">dhossaa qarumma'aa adoo sitti mudhise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">haga si'iif maltee gad</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:6">akka inni si adabe hin beettaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7"/>«Gad fageenna dhossaa Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">qorqortee beekuu dandeettaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:7">Waaqa waan mara dande'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:7">qorqortee bira gewuu dandeettaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8"/>Guddinni isaa ol-gubbaa caalaa ol fagaata.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Ati maan godhuu dandeetta ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 11:8">Gad fageenni isaalle qilee caalaa gad fagaata.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:8">Ati maan beekuu dandeetta ree?<verse eid="JOB 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9"/>Guddinni Waaqaa lafa caalaa dheerata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:9">abbaayaa caalaalle badhata.<verse eid="JOB 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10"/>«Waaqi tana duudii irra dabaree dhufee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">mana hidha'aatitti si galchee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">kora mura'aa sitti rare</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:10">eentu isa dhoogguu dande'a?<verse eid="JOB 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11"/>Inni kolbaa woy hin baane hin beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">inni yennaa yakkaa isaanii dhaggu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:11">cadhisee hin ilaalaa?<verse eid="JOB 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12"/>Yoo harreen diidaa nama dhalte qofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:12">nami gowwaan qaroo te'uu dande'a.<verse eid="JOB 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13"/>«Ati gadhaa keeti yoo qajeelfatte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:13">harka keeti gara Waaqaa yoo badhifatte,<verse eid="JOB 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14"/>yakkaa harka keeti keessa jirtu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">ifi irraa yoo fageessitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">wonni hantuun dunkaana keeti keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:14">akka hin jiraanne yoo goote,<verse eid="JOB 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15"/>yennaa san dhugumaan qaanii malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">mataa keeti ol hin qabatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:15">sodaa maleelle jabaattee hin dhaabbatta.<verse eid="JOB 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16"/>Achiin duuba rakkoo teeti duudii hin deeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:16">akka lolaa yaa'ee dabaree qofa isii qaabatta.<verse eid="JOB 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17"/>Jiruun teeti ifa saafowaa caalaa hin itti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:17">dukkantille akka ganamaa hin teeti.<verse eid="JOB 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18"/>Addiin waan jirtuuf atille addattee hin leeta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">Waaqi waan si eeguuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:18">sodaa malee fooraan hin leeta.<verse eid="JOB 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19"/>Eennulle adoo hin sodaatin hin ratta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">worri hedduun si duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:19">fudhatama dhaggatiisa barbaadan.<verse eid="JOB 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20"/>Ilti worra hama'aa ammoo hin jaamti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">karaa miliqanu hin dhaggatanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 11:20">muummeen isaanii du'a» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 11:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1"/>Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2"/>«Dhuguma isin qaroole'ee motii ree!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">Yennaa duutanulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:2">qarummaan isin woliin duutii motii ree!<verse eid="JOB 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3"/>Ani ammoo akkuma keessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">hubantii qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">ani isinii gadii moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">waan akkasii kana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:3">eentu wollaala ree?<verse eid="JOB 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4"/>«Waaqa daadimadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">yennaan inni naaf deebise jirtiiyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">amma ani waan jaaloti tiyya itti kollitu te'eera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:4">Ani nami balchaan komii hin qanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:4">waan nami duudiin itti kollu te'eera.<verse eid="JOB 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5"/>Worri itti tolte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">rakkinna nama rakkatee tuffatiis kaso'o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:5">nama jigiisaaf tintimu hin darban.<verse eid="JOB 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6"/>Dunkaaniin worra saantotaa nageyaan jirti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">worri Waaqa tuttuqee aarsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">worri Waaqa waan toowatu ifi seyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:6">nageyaan le'a.<verse eid="JOB 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7"/>«Me bineensota gaafadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">Isaan si barsiisan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:7">Sinbirrootalle gaafadhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:7">isaan sitti hin himan.<verse eid="JOB 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8"/>Yookiin lafa gaafadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">isiin si hin barsiitti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">yookiin qurxummiin abbaaya'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:8">sitti hin hinti.<verse eid="JOB 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9"/>Harki Waaqaa akka isaan dade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">isaan kana duudii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:9">ka hin beenne eennu ree?<verse eid="JOB 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10"/>Jiruun waan duudi'iitii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:10">hafuurri nama duudi'ii harka Waaqaa jiran.<verse eid="JOB 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11"/>Akkuma arrabi sagalee addaan baasee beeku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:11">gurrille dubbii addaan hin baasa.<verse eid="JOB 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12"/>Qarummaa maanguddootatti qabaa motii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">Hubantiille worra woggaa dheertuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:12">le'etti qabaa motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13"/>«Qarumma'aa fi hunni ta Waaqaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:13">gorsaa fi hubantiille tama isaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14"/>Waan inni diige,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">nami tokkolle deebisee ijaaruu hin dande'u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 12:14">Nama inni balbala itti cufe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:14">nami tokkolle banuu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15"/>Yoo inni bokkeya dhooggate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">oola'atti te'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">yoo inni bokkeya gad lakkise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:15">lolaan lafa balleessa.<verse eid="JOB 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16"/>Jabeennii fi qarummaan ta isaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">ka sobuu fi ka sobamulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:16">isaan lamaanuu baallii isaa jala jiran.<verse eid="JOB 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17"/>Inni gorsitoota mootichaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">miila duwwaa akka booji'amanu hin godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:17">abbootii mura'aalle hin gowwoonsa.<verse eid="JOB 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18"/>Inni mootota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">barcumaa mootumma'aa irraa buusee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:18">hidhantoota isaan godha.<verse eid="JOB 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19"/>Inni hayyoota irraa baallii isaanii mulqee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:19">worra hunnaameyyiille hin fonqolcha.<verse eid="JOB 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20"/>Worra addatame cadhi godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:20">jaarsoleelle qarummaa hin dhoogga.<verse eid="JOB 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21"/>Inni qondaaltota hin salphisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:21">hidhata worra jajjabaa hin hiika.<verse eid="JOB 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22"/>Inni dhossaa dukkana keessaa hin mudhisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:22">dukkana dimma gara ifaa hin jijjiira.<verse eid="JOB 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23"/>Inni gosa biyya adda addaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">hunnaameyyii hin godha; hin balleessalle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">inni gosa biyya adda addaa hin baceessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:23">hin bittinnessalle'e.<verse eid="JOB 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24"/>Inni sooreyyii irraa hubantii isaanii hin mulqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">goomolee daandii hin qanne keessalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:24">hin joonjisiisa.<verse eid="JOB 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25"/>Isaan ifa malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">dukkana keessa qaqqabataa akka ideemanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">akka nama machoweelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 12:25">akka titimisanu hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 12:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1"/>«Kunoo, tana mara ilti tiyya dhaggiteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:1">gurri kiyyalle dhage'ee hubateera.<verse eid="JOB 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2"/>Waan isin beettanu anille hin beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:2">ani isinii gadii moti.<verse eid="JOB 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3"/>Ani ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">Waaqa waan mara dande'u woliin dubbadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">haajaa kiyya isa woliin falmuu fedha malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:3">si woliinii moti.<verse eid="JOB 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4"/>Isin ammoo dharaan hallitan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">isin akka ogeeyyii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:4">eennulle fayyisuu hin dandeennee ti.<verse eid="JOB 13:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5"/>Ani silaa adoo cadhittane fedha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:5">sun isiniif qarummaa hin teetiiyyu.<verse eid="JOB 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6"/>Amma falmata kiyya dhage'a'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:6">iyyata afaan kiyyaalle caqasa'a.<verse eid="JOB 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7"/>Isin Waaqaaf jettanee dhara dubbattanii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:7">Isaaf jettanee soballe dubbattanii?<verse eid="JOB 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8"/>Isin isaaf rogaartanii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">Kora mura'aa duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:8">haajaa Waaqaaf falmitanii ree?<verse eid="JOB 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9"/>Waaqi yoo isin qorqore</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">isiniif dansa'aa ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:9">Yookiin akkuma nama soddanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:9">Waaqalle sobuu hin dandeettanii ree?<verse eid="JOB 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10"/>Isin dhossa'aan yoo roddane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:10">inni dhugumaan isin hin xixa.<verse eid="JOB 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11"/>Arinyi isaa isin hin bararassuu ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:11">Ulfinni isaa isin hin sodaachisuu ree?<verse eid="JOB 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12"/>Mammaassi keessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">akka daadha'aa bu'aa hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:12">falmiin teessan akka faaraa caccaddi.<verse eid="JOB 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13"/>«Me na irraa cadhisa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">wonni feete natti dhuttuutii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:13">ani hin dubbadha.<verse eid="JOB 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14"/>Ani maaf ifi rakkisee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:14">lubbuu tiyyalle harkatti qabadhee le'a?<verse eid="JOB 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15"/>Waaqi yoo na ijjeeselle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">ani isuma addadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:15">dhugaa tiyyalle isuma duratti falmadha.<verse eid="JOB 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16"/>Worri Waaqa malee le'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">Waaqa dura dhikaatuu waan hin dandeenneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:16">kun fayyinna kiyyaaf te'a fa'a.<verse eid="JOB 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17"/>Dubbii tiyya akka dansaa caqasa'aatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">waan ani jedhulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:17">gurri keessan dhage'uu ti.<verse eid="JOB 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18"/>Ani dubbii tiyya akka dansaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">qopheeffadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:18">akka dhugaa dhaggadhulle hin beeka.<verse eid="JOB 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19"/>«Ka na himatu jiraa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">Yoo jiraate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:19">ani adoo hin falmatin cadhisee hin du'a.<verse eid="JOB 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20"/>«Ee Waaqa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">Akka ani fuula keeti duraa hin dhokanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:20">waan lamaan kana qofa si gaafadha:<verse eid="JOB 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21"/>Na adabiisa lakkisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:21">arnya keetille'een na hin bararassin.<verse eid="JOB 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22"/>Achiin duuba na waami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">anille hin owwaadha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:22">Yookiin ani hin dubbadha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:22">ati deebii naaf kenni.<verse eid="JOB 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23"/>Yakkaan tiyyaa fi cubbuun tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">hagam heddatti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:23">Balleessaa tiyyaa fi cubbuu tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:23">natti himi.<verse eid="JOB 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24"/>Ati maaf fuula keeti na duraa dhoffattee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:24">akka diina keetiititti na laakkotta?<verse eid="JOB 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25"/>Ati akka baala qilleensi fuudhee ideemuu na sodaachisaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:25">akka hicaacee goddu'uu na ariitaa?<verse eid="JOB 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26"/>Ati himannaa hadhoottuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">na irratti barreessite.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 13:26">Gatii yakkaa bara ijoollummaa tiyyaalle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:26">akka dhaggadhu goote.<verse eid="JOB 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27"/>Ati miila kiyya jirma oddu'utti hiiteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">tarkaaffii tiyya duudii hin eedda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:27">faana miila kiyyaalle hin qorqorta.<verse eid="JOB 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28"/>«Tanaaf ani akka waan shamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 13:28">akka woyaa qu'een<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Qu'een: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin barbaaraan yookiin qooqqannaan yookiin biliin jedhamuu hin dande'a.</char></note> nyaattee hin bada.<verse eid="JOB 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1"/>«Barri nama foon uffatee gabaaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:1">sunuu rakko'oon ka guutame.<verse eid="JOB 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2"/>Inni akka daraara'aa mudhatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">yoosuma hin qoora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:2">akka gaaddisaa adoo hin turin hin dabara.<verse eid="JOB 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3"/>Ati nama akkasii kana ilaaltaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:3">Mura'aaf ifi duratti na dhikeessitaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4"/>Waan qulqulluu hin te'in keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">waan qulqulluu baasuu ka dande'u eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:4">Nami tokkolle hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5"/>Barri namaa ka murtaye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">ji'i inni le'uulle si biratti ka laakkowame.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:5">Bara ati isaaf murteessite irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:5">ka dabaru hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6"/>Nami qaxaramee huju</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">hujii ifii yennaa fixu akkuma gammadu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">namille bara dadhabbii ifii keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:6">akka gammadu ossiif.<verse eid="JOB 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7"/>«Muki yoo murame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">deebi'ee waan latuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:7">damee waan baafatuuf addii qaba.<verse eid="JOB 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8"/>Hiddi isaa lafa keessatti dulloomulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:8">jirmi isaalle biyyee keessatti gogulle,<verse eid="JOB 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9"/>foolee bisaaniitiin deebi'ee hin quunxa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">akka biqiltuu reef lattuulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:9">damee hin baafata.<verse eid="JOB 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10"/>Nami ammoo du'ee hin bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:10">eega du'e deebi'ee hin dhaggamu.<verse eid="JOB 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11"/>Akkuma bisaan abbaayaa keessaa ol fiilee dhabamuutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:11">akka bisaan laga keessaa goguu,<verse eid="JOB 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12"/>akkasuma nami du'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">deebi'ee hin ka'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">ol-gubbaan haga dabartutti hin dammaqu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:12">yookiin hirriiba irraa hin ka'u.<verse eid="JOB 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13"/>«Mufiin teeti haga dabartutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">addee worra du'eetitti adoo na dhossitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">guyyaa murteessitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:13">adoo na qaabatte hin fedhaayyu!<verse eid="JOB 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14"/>Nami eega du'e deebi'ee hin jiraataa ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:14">Haga foorri naa dhufutti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">bara dadhabbi'iin lafa irra le'u duudii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:14">ossaan hin eegadha'a.<verse eid="JOB 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15"/>Ati na hin waanta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">anille hin owwaadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:15">ati hujii harka keetii na hin dharraata.<verse eid="JOB 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16"/>Achiin duuba tarkaaffii tiyya duudii hin laakkotta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:16">cubbuu tiyya ammoo natti hin heddu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hin heddu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin herreddu</char></note>.<verse eid="JOB 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17"/>Akka huura subba keessa keyamee gatamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">balleessaa tiyya duudii na irraa hin gatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:17">cubbuu tiyyalle hin balleessita.<verse eid="JOB 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18"/>Akkuma gaarri sigigaatee jijjigu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:18">akkuma rassaalle addee ifii irraa ka'u,<verse eid="JOB 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19"/>akkuma bisaan dhakaa qoqqotu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">akkuma lolaan biyyee haru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:19">atille akkasuma addii namaa hin balleessita.<verse eid="JOB 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20"/>Hunni teeti haga bara baraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">isa irratti hin jabaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">innille hin du'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:20">Bifa isaalle jijjiirtee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:20">ifi duraa hin balleessita.<verse eid="JOB 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21"/>Ilmaan isaa yoo ulfinna dhaggatanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">inni hin beeku.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 14:21">Yoo isaan salphatanulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:21">inni hin dhaggu.<verse eid="JOB 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22"/>Dhibee nafa isaa qofatti itti dhage'ama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 14:22">inni ifi qofaaf bowa» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Eliifaaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1"/>Achiin duuba Eliifaaziin nami qachaa Temaanii deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 15:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2"/>«Nami qaroon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">dubbii hiikkaa hin qanne hin dubbataa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">Gadhaa ifii keessalle'etti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:2">yaada miidhaa qabu qabatuu qabaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3"/>Inni dubbii bu'aa hin qanneen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">yookiin haasowa woy hin baaneen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:3">hin falmataa ree?<verse eid="JOB 15:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4"/>Ati ammoo Waaqa sodaatiisa lakkitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:4">waaqonfannaa isaaf maltelle hin gufachiitta.<verse eid="JOB 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5"/>Yakkaan teeti dubbii teetiin beekkanti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">ati ammoo akka worra malte'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:5">dubbatiisa filatta.<verse eid="JOB 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6"/>Dubbuma teetittuu sitti mura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">arrabuma keetittuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">dhugaa si irratti baya malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:6">anaa moti.<verse eid="JOB 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7"/>«Nama duudi'iin dura ka dhalate si'ii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:7">Ati gaaroti adoo hin dadaminiin dura dadantee ree?<verse eid="JOB 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8"/>Marii Waaqaa ta dhossa'aa dhageetteertaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:8">Qarummaa nama duudi'ii ka beeku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:8">si qofa seetaa?<verse eid="JOB 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9"/>Waan nuuti hin beenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:9">maan beetta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:9">Waan nu'uuf ifa hin te'in maan hubatte?<verse eid="JOB 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10"/>Worri mataan isaanii arrii te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">ka abbaa keeti caalaa dulloomane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:10">nu woliin jiran.<verse eid="JOB 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11"/>Jajjabeessiis Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">yookiin jechi inni malaan sitti dubbate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:11">si hin gewuu?<verse eid="JOB 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12"/>Qalbiin teeti maaf si fudhattee ideenti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:12">Aari'iin ila teeti maaf baatta?<verse eid="JOB 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13"/>Maaf Waaqatti aartee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:13">dubbiin akkasii afaan keetii baati?<verse eid="JOB 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14"/>«Nami qulqulluu te'uu hin dande'aa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:14">Nami foon uffate balchaa te'uu dande'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15"/>Waaqi ergantoota ifiitittuu hin addatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:15">ol-gubbaanuu isa duratti qulqullu'uu moti.<verse eid="JOB 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16"/>Nami yakkaa akka bisaanii unu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:16">attam attam bada'aa fi battowa'a ree!<verse eid="JOB 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17"/>«Ani waan dhagge hin dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:17">sitti hima na caqasi.<verse eid="JOB 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18"/>Sunille waan worri qaroon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">abbootii ifii irraa fuudhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:18">adoo hin dhossin dubbate.<verse eid="JOB 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19"/>Latti abbootii isaanii qofaaf kennanteertiiyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:19">ormille odduu isaanii hin leene.<verse eid="JOB 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20"/>Nami hamaan ka nama cunqursaa le'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:20">bara ifii duudii farraa le'a.<verse eid="JOB 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21"/>Qoonqoon bararassitu gurra isaatitti iyyiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">yennaa wonni marti nageya itti fakkaattutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:21">ka balleessu isatti hin dhufa.<verse eid="JOB 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22"/>Shallaagaan isa waan eegatuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">inni dukkana keessaa bayiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:22">addii hin qabu.<verse eid="JOB 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23"/>Sagalee allaatti'ii te'iisaaf hin joonja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:23">guyyaan dukkanaa akka isatti dhikaatelle hin beeka.<verse eid="JOB 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24"/>Gaddaa fi laaleffati isa bararassan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:24">akka mooticha lolaaf qophowee itti hammaatan.<verse eid="JOB 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25"/>Inni harka ifii Waaqa irratti waan kaaseef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">Waaqa waan mara dande'u irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:25">jabaa waan ifi fakkeesseef,<verse eid="JOB 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26"/>mataa jabinnaan wontee ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">furdoo-jadduu fudhatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:26">ifi irraa dhooggatiisaaf itti fiiga.<verse eid="JOB 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27"/>«Fuulli isaa coomaan gollameera<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gollameera: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin bobbokokeer.</char></note>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:27">hidhi isaa coomaan furdateera.<verse eid="JOB 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28"/>Nami kun qachoota diigame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">mana nami keessa hin leene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:28">ka diigamiisaaf dhikaate keessa le'a.<verse eid="JOB 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29"/>Inni hin duroomu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">karri isaalle yennaa heddu'uuf hin turtu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:29">lafa irralle'etti hin babadhattu.<verse eid="JOB 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30"/>Inni dukkana jalaa hin miliqu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">akka muka dameelee isaa bobeenni ibiddaa gosseetii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:30">daraaraan isaalle hafuura aarii Waaqaatiin harca'ee hin te'a.<verse eid="JOB 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31"/>Inni womaa waan irraa hin dhagganneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:31">waan bu'aa hin qannetti addatiisaan ifi hin sobin.<verse eid="JOB 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32"/>Akka muka jirmi isaa yennaan adoo hin geyin goguutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:32">dameeleen isaa hin bisillee hin te'a.<verse eid="JOB 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33"/>Inni akka muka woyni'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ka unkuruura ifii adoo hin bilchaatin harcaafatuutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">akka muka ejersaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:33">ka daraaraa ifii harcaafatuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34"/>Worri yaada Waaqa malee le'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">sanyii hin qabaatu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 15:34">Manni safu'uun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Safu'uun: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin malaamaltumma'aa.</char></note> ijaarame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:34">ibiddaan gubatee bada.<verse eid="JOB 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35"/>Worri akkas jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">hammeenna karoorfataa rakkinna fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 15:35">gadhaan isaaniille sobaan guutameera» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 15:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 16:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2"/>«Ani dubbii akkasii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">hedduu dhage'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:2">isin marti jajjabeessitoota nama hifachiittanu.<verse eid="JOB 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3"/>Dubbiin teessan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">ta bu'aa hin qanne tun hin dhumattuu?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 16:3">Yookiin akka ati na woliin falmiisa hin lakkinneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:3">maanti si kakkaasa?<verse eid="JOB 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4"/>Adoo isin addee tiyya buutanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">ani addee teessan bu'ee jiraadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">murgo'oon mataa isinitti raasaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">akkuma isin amma jettanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:4">anille isin irratti miidhassee dubbadhaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5"/>Dubbii afaan kiyyaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">silaa isin hin jajjabeessaayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">isin jabeessiisaafille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:5">guddoo dubbatuu dande'aayyu.<verse eid="JOB 16:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6"/>«Ani yoo guddoo dubbadhelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">dhibeen tiyya hin goontu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:6">yoo osselle dhibeen tiyya na hin lakkittu.<verse eid="JOB 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7"/>Waaqa kiyya, ati na daddassiitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:7">maatii tiyya duudiille balleessiteerta.<verse eid="JOB 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8"/>Ati na shuntuurachiitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">shuntuuratiis nafa kiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">na irratti dhugaa bayaa te'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">huqqinni kiyya na irratti ka'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:8">akka ani cubbuu huje dhugaa hin baya.<verse eid="JOB 16:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9"/>Waaqi mufii ifiitiin nafa kiyya kukkute</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">inni hidhii natti ciniinnatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:9">diinni kiyyalle ila natti diimeffate.<verse eid="JOB 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10"/>Namooti na ceeggatiisaaf afaan ifii natti banane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">tuffiille'een na dhabanaasanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:10">wolitti qabamanee natti ka'ane.<verse eid="JOB 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11"/>Waaqi kolbaa hantu'utti dabarsee na kennee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:11">harka worra hama'aatitti na gate.<verse eid="JOB 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12"/>Ani nageyaan le'aa tureeyyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">Waaqi ammoo mufii ifiitiin na hargufe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">inni morma kiyya hudhee na butuchee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:12">waan itti xiyyeeffatu na godhate.<verse eid="JOB 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13"/>Worri guube'ee ka isaa na marsee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">marartii malee kalattii tiyya kukkutee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:13">hadhoottuu tiyyalle lafatti jisse.<verse eid="JOB 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14"/>Inni itti deddeebi'ee na madeesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:14">akka loltu'uu gara kiyya ori'e.<verse eid="JOB 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15"/>«Ani gaddee woyaa gaddaa uffadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:15">bukuu keessalle'etti jigeera.<verse eid="JOB 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16"/>Fuulli kiyya bowichaan diimatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:16">ilti tiyya dhagguu dadhaddeerti;<verse eid="JOB 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17"/>tun duudiin teetulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">ani hunnaan nama irratti hin kaane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:17">daadimati kiyyalle qulqullu'u.<verse eid="JOB 16:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18"/>«Ee lafa, dhiiga kiyya hin dhossin!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:18">Iyyi tiyya si biratti ukkaamantee hin hafin!<verse eid="JOB 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19"/>Kunoo ka dhugaa naa bayuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:19">wobiin kiyya ol-gubbaa jira.<verse eid="JOB 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20"/>Jaaloti tiyya na tuffatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:20">ani ammoo gara Waaqaa bowa.<verse eid="JOB 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21"/>Akkuma nami nama kadhatee wolitti araarsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">nami namaa fi Waaqa wolitti araarsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:21">adoo hin jiraatuu!<verse eid="JOB 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22"/>«Ani deensa deebi'ee hin deebine deemiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 16:22">woggaa diqqoo qofatti naa hafeera.<verse eid="JOB 16:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1"/>Qooqqee qofatti na keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">barri jiruu tiyyaa haleelameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:1">awwaallille na eegata.<verse eid="JOB 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2"/>Dhugumaan worri natti murgu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">na marsaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:2">ilti tiyyalle nunnuussaa isaaniititti xiyyeeffatti.<verse eid="JOB 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3"/>«Waaqa kiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">ka si woliin wobii naaf te'u naa kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">si'uma malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:3">ka dhibiin ka wobii naaf te'u eennu ree?<verse eid="JOB 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4"/>Akka isaan hin hubanneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">qalbii isaanii cutteerta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:4">tanaaf akka isaan injifatanu hin gootu.<verse eid="JOB 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5"/>Nama beese'eef jedhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">jaala ifii dabarsee kennu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:5">ijoolleen isaa hin rakkatti.<verse eid="JOB 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6"/>«Waaqi nama nami marti fuulatti tufu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:6">nama duudi'iifille ka mammaassaa na godhe.<verse eid="JOB 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7"/>Gadda irraa ta kaate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">ilti tiyya dhagguu dadhaddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:7">nafi kiyya duudiin akka gaaddiddu'uu te'eera.<verse eid="JOB 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8"/>Worri qajeelaa ifi seyu waan kana maadeffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">worri yakkaa hin qanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:8">worra Waaqa malee le'utti ka'a.<verse eid="JOB 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9"/>Te'uu malee balchooti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">karaa dhuga'aa irraa hin goranu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">worri harki isaanii qulqullu'uu ifi seyanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:9">jabeenna irratti jabeenna ede'atan.<verse eid="JOB 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10"/>«Isin marti ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">deebi'aatii ammalle wodhaana'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 17:10">Ani odduu teessanitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:10">nama qaroo hin dhaggu.<verse eid="JOB 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11"/>Barri le'ii tiyya hobba'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">karoorrii fi halchaan gadhaa kiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:11">karaa irratti hafane.<verse eid="JOB 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12"/>Jarri tun halkan guyyaa gooti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:12">yennaa dukkanaa, ‹Ifi dhikaateera› jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13"/>Boolla awwaalaa akka mana kiyyaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">yoo ilaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:13">taqee tiyya dukkana keessatti yoo afadhe,<verse eid="JOB 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14"/>boolla awwaalaatiin, ‹Ati abbaa kiyya›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">corroqa na nyaattulle'een,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:14">‹Haadha tiyya yookiin obboleettii tiyya› yoo jedhe,<verse eid="JOB 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15"/>addiin tiyya meet ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:15">Addii tiyya tana eentu naaf dhagga ree?<verse eid="JOB 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16"/>Yoo ani gara boolla awwaalaa bu'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">addiin tiyya na woliin gad buutii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 17:16">wolille'een biyyee seennaa ree?» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 17:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Biildaad</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1"/>Achiin duuba Biildaad nami biyya Shu'aa deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2"/>«Iyoob, ati yoom dubbattee fixxa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:2">Caqasi, nuutille hin dubbanna.<verse eid="JOB 18:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3"/>Ati maaf akka hori'ii nu laakkotta?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:3">Ila teeti duralle'etti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:3">maaf akka gowwa'aatitti nu laakkotta?<verse eid="JOB 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4"/>Ati aarii teetiin ifuu miita malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">latti sababa keetiif hin ontu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:4">yookiin rassaan addee ifii irraa hin tacho'u.<verse eid="JOB 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5"/>Issaan worra hamaaleyyi'ii hin dhaama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:5">bobeenni ibidda isaaniille ijjumaa hin bobe'u.<verse eid="JOB 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6"/>Issaan dunkaanii isaanii keessa jiru hin dhaama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:6">ifille hin dukkanowa.<verse eid="JOB 18:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7"/>Hunni tarkaaffii isaanii hin laatti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hin laatti: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin dadhaddi.</char></note>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:7">malli isaaniituu isaan hin gufachiisa.<verse eid="JOB 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8"/>Miilli isaaniituu tiyyoo keessa isaan hin galcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:8">gara boolla keessa bu'anuulle hin deeman.<verse eid="JOB 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9"/>Tiyyoon komee isaanii hin qaddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:9">fonxoroolle jabeessitee isaan hin qaddi.<verse eid="JOB 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10"/>Wodaroon isaan qaddu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">lafa keessatti dhoffanteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:10">tiyyoolle karaa isaanii irratti afanteerti.<verse eid="JOB 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11"/>Wonni nama bararassu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">isaan marsiteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:11">hordotteelle isaan hin ariiti.<verse eid="JOB 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12"/>Hunni isaanii beelaan dhumatteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:12">badiille qophoottee isaan eegatti.<verse eid="JOB 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13"/>Dhukkubi gogaa nafa isaanii hin fixa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:13">duuti harkaa fi miila isaaniille hin nyaatti.<verse eid="JOB 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14"/>Dunkaanii addatanee le'anu keessaa hin ari'aman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:14">gara mootummaa du'aalle hin geeffaman.<verse eid="JOB 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15"/>Mana isaanii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">wonni takkaalle hin hattu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:15">Qe'ee isaaniititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:15">dhakaan bobe'u hin firfirfama.<verse eid="JOB 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16"/>Isaan akka muka hidda hunde'een goguutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:16">dameeleen isaa qoortuu hin te'an.<verse eid="JOB 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17"/>Qaabbiin isaanii lafa irraa hin baddi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:17">maqaan isaaniille lafa irraa hin bada.<verse eid="JOB 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18"/>Isaan ifa irraa gara dukkanaatitti hin ari'aman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:18">biyya lafaa irralle'ee hin balleeffaman.<verse eid="JOB 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19"/>Odduu kolbaa ifiitii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">dhala yookiin sanyii hin qabaatanu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 18:19">Addee isaan le'anulle'etti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:19">ka jiru'uun hafu hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20"/>Worri gara aduun baatuutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">gara aduun seentuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">waan isaan irra geye dhage'anee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:20">sodaa guddo'oon qabamane.<verse eid="JOB 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21"/>Qe'een worra Waaqa malee le'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">addeen nama Waaqa hin beenneelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 18:21">akkas teeti» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 18:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 19:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2"/>«Isin haga yoomii na farrisiittan?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:2">Haga yoomii jechaan lafee na cassitan?<verse eid="JOB 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3"/>Isin deddeebitanee na arrassitan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:3">daba na irratti hujjanuuf hin fokkifattanuu?<verse eid="JOB 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4"/>Dhuguma yoo dokonkoree jiraadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:4">dokonkorri sun anuma qofa miidha.<verse eid="JOB 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5"/>Dhuguma isin na irratti ifi ol ol qaddanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">qaanii tiyya waan anaan morontanuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:5">yoo godhattane,<verse eid="JOB 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6"/>ka na farrisiisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">tiyyoo ifiitiin na marsee xaxe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:6">Waaqa akka te'e beeka'a.<verse eid="JOB 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7"/>«‹Hunnaan na irratti ka'ane› jedhee iyyadhulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">deebii hin dhagganne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:7">Qoonqoo tiyya ol qabadhee dhageessifadhulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:7">muraa haqaa hin dhagganne.<verse eid="JOB 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8"/>Waaqi akka ani hin dabarreef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">karaa natti cufeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:8">daandii tiyyalle dukkanaan golleera.<verse eid="JOB 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9"/>Inni ulfinna kiyya na irraa fuudhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:9">kallachalle mataa kiyya irraa buuseera.<verse eid="JOB 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10"/>Inni karaa maraan nafa kiyya caccassee hurbee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:10">addii tiyyalle akka mukaa buqqiseera.<verse eid="JOB 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11"/>Inni mufii ifii na irratti bobeessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:11">akka diina ifiititti na laakkowe.<verse eid="JOB 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12"/>Inni na balleessiisaaf loltoota ifii erge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">isaan adaala dunkaanii tiyyaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:12">kushee hujatanee qubatane.<verse eid="JOB 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13"/>«Waaqi obboleeyyan tiyya na irraa fageesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:13">worri na beekulle alagaa akka natti te'u godhe.<verse eid="JOB 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14"/>Firri kiyya na irraa fagaate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:14">jaaloti tiyyalle na dedhane.<verse eid="JOB 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15"/>Keessummooti ani mana kiyyatti keessummeesse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">na dedhane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:15">Dubartooti tajaajiltooti tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">akka ormaatitti na laakkowane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:15">akka alaga'aalle na ilaalane.<verse eid="JOB 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16"/>Ani tajaajilaa kiyya waame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">inni ammoo na jalaa dide;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:16">akka na qarqaaruuf yennaa kadhadhelle na didate.<verse eid="JOB 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17"/>Haati manaa tiyya foolee hafuura kiyyaa jibbite;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:17">obboleeyyan tiyyaayyuu na diqatte.<verse eid="JOB 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18"/>Ijoolleen didiqoonuu na tuffatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:18">yennaa na dhagganu natti murgan.<verse eid="JOB 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19"/>Jaaloti tiyya ta ani addadhu na diqatte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:19">worri ani jaaladhulle na irratti ka'e.<verse eid="JOB 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20"/>Foon kiyya dhumatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">gogaan kiyya lafee tiyyatti maxxanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:20">irgi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Irgi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lafa tokko tokkotti </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">irgagi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedhama.</char></note> ilkaan kiyyaa callaan jiruun ani hafe.<verse eid="JOB 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21"/>«Ee jaalota tiyya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">harki Waaqaa waan na dhoweef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">naaf marara'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:21">Naaf marara'a!<verse eid="JOB 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22"/>Akkuma Waaqi na miidhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">isinille maaf na miitan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 19:22">Haga ammaa ka na miitane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:22">isin hin gewuu?<verse eid="JOB 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23"/>«Maalo'o, dubbiin ani haga ammaa dubbadhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:23">barreeffantee, kitaabatti adoo galmeeffantee!<verse eid="JOB 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24"/>Maalo'o, bara baraan akka yaadatantuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">meya sibiilaatii fi irsaasaatiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:24">rassaa irratti qiriixantee adoo hin barreeffantuu!<verse eid="JOB 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25"/>Ka na wodu jiraataa akka te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">muummee irralle'etti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:25">dhugaa bayiisaaf lafa irra akka dhaabbatu hin beeka.<verse eid="JOB 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26"/>Gogaan kiyya nyaatamee dhumateen duuba te'ulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">foon kiyyaan jiraadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:26">Waaqa akka dhaggu hin addadha.<verse eid="JOB 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27"/>Anumattuu isa dhagga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ani ila tiyyaan isuma dhagga malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">ka dhibi'ii moti.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:27">Gadhaan kiyya guyyaa san guddoo dharra'a.<verse eid="JOB 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28"/>«Isin, ‹Sababi rakko'ootuu isuma keessa waan jirtuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:28">nuuti attam isa miina?› yoo jettane,<verse eid="JOB 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29"/>mufiin Waaqaa shallaaga'aan adabamiisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">waan fidduuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">isin shallaagaa san sodaadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 19:29">muraalle akka jirtu beeka'a» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 19:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Zofaarii Naa'imaaticha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1"/>Achiin duuba Zofaariin Naa'imaatichi deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 20:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2"/>«Iyoob, ani deebii akka kennuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">yaadi kiyya na dirqansiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:2">tanaaf dubbatiisaaf ariifadha.<verse eid="JOB 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3"/>Arraffama ittiin salphadhe dhage'adheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">hubatiis kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:3">akka ani deebii kennu na godheera.<verse eid="JOB 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4"/>«Bara durii durii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">yennaa nami biyya lafaa irratti dadameen jalqabee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:4">dubbii akkasii tana beettaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5"/>Qaca'iis worra hama'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">haguma diqqa'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 20:5">Gammadi worra Waaqa malee le'uulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:5">haga lipheettii ilaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 20:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6"/>Isaan haga ol-gubba'aa ifi ol ol qabanulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:6">mataan isaanii duumensa tuqulle,<verse eid="JOB 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7"/>isaan akkuma faalowa ifii hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">worri dur isaan dhaggeeru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:7">‹Isaan meet ree?› hin jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8"/>Isaan akka oojju'uu waan badanuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">hin dhaggamanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:8">akka mudhii halkaniille hin badan.<verse eid="JOB 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9"/>Ilti tanaan dura isaan dhaggite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">deebitee isaan hin dhaggitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:9">isaan addee le'anu irralle'ee hin badan.<verse eid="JOB 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10"/>Ijoolleen isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">waan abbootiin isaanii hiyyeeyyii irraa saante</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:10">sossobataa hin deebitti.<verse eid="JOB 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11"/>Nafi isaanii ka hunna dargaggumma'aatiin guutame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:11">isaan woliin biyyee hin te'a.<verse eid="JOB 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12"/>«Hammeenni afaan isaanii keessatti mi'owee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:12">arraba ifiitiin jalatti dhossanee,<verse eid="JOB 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13"/>afaan ifii keessaa baasuu jibbanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:13">afaan ifii keessatti qabatanulle,<verse eid="JOB 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14"/>sagaleen isaanii gadhaa isaanii keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">gara hadha'aatitti hin jijjiiranti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:14">akka hadhaa dhudhuufa'aalle hin teeti.<verse eid="JOB 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15"/>Isaan karra nyaatane hin tufan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">Waaqi waan isaan nyaatane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:15">akka diddiganu hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16"/>Wonni isaan nyaatanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">hadhaa dhudhuufa'aa itti hin teeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:16">hadhaa buuti'iille itti teetee isaan hin ijjeetti.<verse eid="JOB 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17"/>Isaan bisaanii fi laga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:17">ka dammaa fi itittuu woliin yaa'u hin dhagganu.<verse eid="JOB 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18"/>Waan ifii itti elowane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">adoo hin nyaatin deebisanee hin kennan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:18">bu'aa daldalanee dhaggatanelle'etti hin gammadanu.<verse eid="JOB 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19"/>Isaan hiyyeeyyii cunqursanee duwwaa hamburanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:19">mana ifii hin ijaarinille waan fudhataneef tun teete.<verse eid="JOB 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20"/>«Joljolummaan isaanii foora isaan dhooggiteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:20">qabeenni isaanii isaan baasuu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21"/>Isaan waan qabanu nyaatanee hin fixan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:21">tanaaf qabeenni isaanii dafee hin dhumata.<verse eid="JOB 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22"/>Qabeenna hedduu qabaatanulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">deegi isaanitti hin bu'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:22">rakkoon jadduulle isaan hin dhaqqaddi.<verse eid="JOB 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23"/>Isaan nyaatanee yennaa quufanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">Waaqi aarii ifii isaan irratti bobeessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">balaa ifii akka bokkeyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:23">isaan irratti hin roobisiisa.<verse eid="JOB 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24"/>Shallaagaa sibiilaa jalaa yoo miliqe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:24">daaya sageettu'uutiin hin woraanama.<verse eid="JOB 20:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25"/>Daayi sun woraanee duddaan isa fulla'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">qacceen calalaxxuun arfii sanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">tiruu isaanii keessa baati;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:25">naasuulle'een hin qabaman.<verse eid="JOB 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26"/>Qabeenni isaanii duudiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">dukkana dimmaa keessatti bada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">ibiddi hin dhaanne isaan hin guba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">waan dunkaana isaanii keessa hafelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:26">muxuq godha.<verse eid="JOB 20:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27"/>Ol-gubbaan yakkaa isaanii hin mudhitti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:27">lattille diinumma'aan isaan irratti hin kaati.<verse eid="JOB 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28"/>Guyyaa mufii Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:28">qabeenni mana isaanii lola'aan hin fudhatama.<verse eid="JOB 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29"/>Qoodi Waaqi worra hama'aaf kennu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 20:29">gatiin isaaniille tana» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 20:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1"/>Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 21:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2"/>«Waan ani dubbadhu miidhassa'aa caqasa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:2">kun akka na jajjabeesitanetti isiniif laakkowamuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3"/>Ani hin dubbadhaa naaf ossadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:3">achiin duuba akka feetane murguu dandeettan.<verse eid="JOB 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4"/>«Ani nama komadhaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:4">Maaf ossa hin dhanne ree?<verse eid="JOB 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5"/>Ana ilaala'aatii maadeffadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:5">afaan keessanille qabadha'a.<verse eid="JOB 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6"/>Ani waan kana yennaa yaadadhu hin bararaqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:6">nafi kiyyalle hin hollata.<verse eid="JOB 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7"/>Worri hamaan maaf le'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">Maaf ganna dheeraa le'ee dullooma?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:7">maaf hunnaan ittuma jabaataa deema?<verse eid="JOB 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8"/>Ijoolle'ee fi akaakoti isaanii adoo isaan jiraranuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:8">fuula isaanii duratti guddatanee itti tolteen dhaggan<verse eid="JOB 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9"/>Isaan mana ifii keessa sodaa malee nageyaan le'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:9">Waaqi isaan hin adabu.<verse eid="JOB 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10"/>Horiin isaanii rakkoo tokko malee hora;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:10">loon isaaniille rimeya gadha'aa hin gatanu.<verse eid="JOB 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11"/>Ijoollee ifii akka tika hoole'ee bobbaasan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:11">daa'immaan isaaniille hin burraaxxi.<verse eid="JOB 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12"/>Isaan dibbe'ee fi maseenqo'oon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">qoonqoo suusulle'eetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:12">gammadanee hin sirban.<verse eid="JOB 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13"/>Isaan qananumma'aan bara ifii fixatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:13">farra malee du'an.<verse eid="JOB 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14"/>«Isaan Waaqaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">‹Nuuti karaa keeti beekuu hin feenu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:14">nu irraa fagaadhu.<verse eid="JOB 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15"/>Nuuti akka isa waaqonfannuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">ka waan mara dande'u eennu inni?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:15">Isa yoo daadimanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:15">bu'aa maan dhagganna?› jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16"/>Qananummaan isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">harkuma isaanii keessa jirtii motii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:16">Maarre ani yaada worra hama'aa hin fudhadhu.<verse eid="JOB 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17"/>«Issaan worra hama'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">yennaa mara attam attam bada?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">Farri yennaa maraa attam attam isaanitti dhutti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:17">Isaan yennaa mara adabbii mufii ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:17">attam attam farrane?<verse eid="JOB 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18"/>Isaan akka huura qilleensa dura jiruutii motii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:18">Akka cidii bubbe'een fudhatantuutii motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 21:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19"/>Isin ‹Waaqi yakkaa abbooti'iitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">ijoollee hin adaba› jettan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">te'uu malee yakkaameyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">yakkaa ifii akka beekanuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:19">isaanunti adabamanuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20"/>Cubbaaleyyiin yakkaa ifiitiif adabamanuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">Waaqi waan mara dande'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:20">mufii ifii isaanitti buusuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21"/>Nami du'een duuba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">marroo ijoollee ifiitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:21">maanti isa dhiba?<verse eid="JOB 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22"/>«Waaqa worra gugurda'attuu muru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:22">nami beekkumsa isa barsiisuu dande'aa ree?<verse eid="JOB 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23"/>Nami gariin adoo hunna qabuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:23">le'iin itti toltee nageyaan adoo jiruu,<verse eid="JOB 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24"/>nafi isaa adoo gabbinna qabuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:24">lafee isaa keessa dhuki guuttee adoo jirtuu du'a.<verse eid="JOB 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25"/>Nami dhibiin ammoo jiruun itti hadhoottee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:25">waan dansaa adoo hin dhaggin du'a.<verse eid="JOB 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26"/>Isaan lamaanuu du'anee awwaalamanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:26">corroxxille itti duuddi.<verse eid="JOB 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27"/>«Kunoo, ani yaada keessan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">mala isin na miidhiisaaf maltanelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:27">miidhassee beeka.<verse eid="JOB 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28"/>Isin, ‹Manni nama guddaa sanii meet ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:28">Dunkaaniin worra hama'aa keessa meet ree?› jettan.<verse eid="JOB 21:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29"/>Isin worra karaa yaa'u hin gaafannee ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:29">Waan isaan jedhanelle hin fudhannee ree?<verse eid="JOB 21:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30"/>Nama hamaa balaan yennaa dhufu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">miidhaan isa hin dhaqqabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:30">guyyaa mufii Waaqaalle jalaa hin baya.<verse eid="JOB 21:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31"/>Nama hamaa amala isaa ka isa duratti komatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:31">hujii hantuu isaatiifille ka isa adabu eennu ree?<verse eid="JOB 21:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32"/>Yennaa inni du'e gara awwaalaa hin geessan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:32">Irreensi isaalle hin eegama.<verse eid="JOB 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33"/>Biyyeen dhooqa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">isatti hin tolti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 21:33">Namooti bacaan isa duubaan deeman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:33">kolbaan bindillaalle isa dura deenti.<verse eid="JOB 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34"/>«Deebiin isin naaf kennitanu soba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">attamiin dubbii woy hin baaneen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 21:34">na jajjabeessiisaaf wodhaantan ree?» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 21:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Eliifaaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1"/>Achiin duuba Eliifaaziin Temaanichi deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 22:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2"/>«Nami Waaqaaf bu'aa qabaatuu dande'aa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:2">Nami qaroolle bu'aa ifumaaf buufata.<verse eid="JOB 22:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3"/>Ati balchaa yoo teete, balchummaan teeti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">Waaqa waan mara dande'u maan gammachiitti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 22:3">Karaan keeti ka komii hin qanne yoo te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:3">inni woy dhaggataa ree?<verse eid="JOB 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4"/>«Ati Waaqa waan sodaattuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:4">inni si xixee muraa si irratti fidee ree?<verse eid="JOB 22:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5"/>Tun sababa hammeenni keeti guddatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:5">cubbuun teeti bacatteefii motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6"/>Ati sababa malee obboleeyyan teeti irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">qaddii fudhatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">namoota irraa woyaa mulqitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:6">qullaa hamburteerta.<verse eid="JOB 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7"/>Ati worra dheebotee dadhabeef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">bisaan hin kennine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:7">worra beelowelle sagalee dhooggatteerta.<verse eid="JOB 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8"/>Latti ta worra hunnaameyyi'ii ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:8">worra ulfinna qabutti isii irra le'a.<verse eid="JOB 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9"/>Haadhotii hiyyeessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">harka duwwaa gad lakkitteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:9">ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qanneelle cunqursiteerta.<verse eid="JOB 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10"/>Tanaaf tiyyoon si marsitee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:10">dedhuma sodaan si bararassite.<verse eid="JOB 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11"/>Akka ati dhagguu hin dandeenne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">dukkanti si qaddee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:11">lolaan si liqinse.<verse eid="JOB 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12"/>«Waaqi ol-gubbaa olii keessa le'aa motii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">Urjoota ol fagoo jiranulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:12">gad ilaalaa motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13"/>Ati ammoo, ‹Waaqi maan beeka?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">Dukkana dimmaatiin gara kaan jiraatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:13">natti muruu dande'aa?<verse eid="JOB 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14"/>Inni gonbobittii ol-gubba'aa irra yennaa deddeemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">duumensi hurrantaan waan isa golluuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:14">dhagguu hin dande'u› jetta.<verse eid="JOB 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15"/>Ati karaa durii ka worri hamaan irra deddeeme</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:15">hordofaartaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16"/>Isaan adoo yennaan isaanii hin geyiinuu qoomamaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:16">hundeen isaanii lola'aan haxowanteerti.<verse eid="JOB 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17"/>Isaan Waaqa waan mara dande'uun, ‹Nu irraa fagaadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:17">maan nuu godhuu dandeetta?› jedhane.<verse eid="JOB 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18"/>Te'uu malee isumattuu mana isaanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">waan dansa'aan guute;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:18">tanaaf ani yaada worra hama'aa hin fudhadhu.<verse eid="JOB 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19"/>«Balchooti badii worra hamootaa dhagganee hin gammadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:19">worri yakkaa hin qanne murgo'oof itti kollaa,<verse eid="JOB 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20"/>‹Dhuguma diinni keenna badeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:20">waan isaan irraa hafelle ibiddi fixeera› jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21"/>«Iyoob, Waaqaan wolii galiitii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">isa woliin nageya qabaadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:21">karaa kanaan waan dansaa hin dhaggatta.<verse eid="JOB 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22"/>Qajeelcha inni sii kennu fudhadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:22">jecha isaalle gadhaa keetitti qabadhu.<verse eid="JOB 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23"/>Ati gara Waaqa waan mara dande'uu yoo deebite,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">akka duriititti hin deebita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:23">hammeenna dunkaanii teeti keessaa yoo fageessite,<verse eid="JOB 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24"/>worqii akka buku'uutitti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">worqii gatii guddo'oolle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Worqii gatii guddo'oolle: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Afaan Ibrootaatiin worqii Ofiiriille </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jedha. Bara san worqii Ofiirii gatii guddo'oon bitatan.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:24">akka rassaa bisaan keessaatitti yoo ilaalte,<verse eid="JOB 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25"/>Waaqi waan mara dande'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:25">worqi'ii fi meetii gatii guddo'oo siif hin te'a.<verse eid="JOB 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26"/>Achiin duuba ati</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">Waaqa waan mara dande'uun hin gammadda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:26">isalle'etti addattee hin leeta.<verse eid="JOB 22:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27"/>Ati gara isaa hin daadimatta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">innille si'iif hin dhage'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:27">atille waadaa keeti isaaf hin galchita.<verse eid="JOB 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28"/>Wonni ati murteeffatte siif hin teeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:28">ifille karaa keetitti hin ifa.<verse eid="JOB 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29"/>Waaqi worra kooru gad qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:29">worra ifi gad qabu ammoo hin fayyisa.<verse eid="JOB 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30"/>Sababa ati yakkaa hin qanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">Waaqi worra yakkaameyyi'iiyyuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 22:30">adabbii jalaa hin baasa» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 23:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2"/>«Ani iyyaa aadulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">dhowichi isaa waan natti jabaateef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">haga ammaa gadhaan kiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:2">gadda hama'aa fi gungussu'uun guutameera.<verse eid="JOB 23:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3"/>Addee isa itti dhaggu adoo beeke,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:3">gara addee inni le'uu dhaqee,<verse eid="JOB 23:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4"/>silaa iyyata kiyya isatti dhikeeffadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:4">afaan kiyya guutadhee isatti hin dubbadhaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5"/>Waan inni naaf deebisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">sila hin beekaayyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">waan inni naan jedhulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:5">sila hin hubadhaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6"/>Waaqi hunna ifii guddo'oon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:6">na morminnaa laati?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:6">Waawwo'o! Inni naaf hin dhage'a.<verse eid="JOB 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7"/>Achitti nami qajeelaan haajaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">Waaqa duratti dhikeeffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">Waaqi abbaan mura'aa kiyyalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:7">haga bara baraa bilisa na hin baasa.<verse eid="JOB 23:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8"/>«Ani gara aduun baatu yoo dhaqe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">inni achi hin jiru.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:8">Gara aduun seentulle yoo deebi'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:8">isa dhagguu hin dandeenne.<verse eid="JOB 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9"/>Yennaa inni gara kaabaatiin huju</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ani isa dhagguu hin dande'u.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 23:9">Yennaa inni gara kibbaallee deebi'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:9">ani isa dhagguu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10"/>Inni ammoo karaa ani deemu mara hin beeka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">yennaa inni haga na ilaalu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:10">akka worqi'ii qulqulluu te'eeruun na dhagga.<verse eid="JOB 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11"/>Miilli kiyya faana isaa gula deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:11">karaa isaa irraa asii fi achi hin goru.<verse eid="JOB 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12"/>Ajaja afaan isaatii bawu irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">ani hin fagaanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:12">jecha isaalle gadhaa kiyyatti qabadheera.<verse eid="JOB 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13"/>«Waaqi hin jijjiiramu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">eennulle isa mormuu hin dande'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:13">inni waan fedhe godha.<verse eid="JOB 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14"/>Inni waan naaf yaade mara hin muummessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:14">wonni hedduun akkasii qalbii isaa keessa jirti.<verse eid="JOB 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15"/>Tanaaf ani isa duratti hin bararaqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:15">yennaa waan kana mara hedu isa sodaadha.<verse eid="JOB 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16"/>Waaqi na sodaachise;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:16">ka waan mara dande'u na bararasse.<verse eid="JOB 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17"/>Te'uu malee ani dukkanaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 23:17">dukkana dimma fuula kiyya gollite saniin hin cadhinne.<verse eid="JOB 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1"/>«Waaqi waan mara dande'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">guyyaa mura'aa maaf hin murteessin?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:1">Worri isa beekanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:1">guyyaa mura'aa san maaf hin dhaggin?<verse eid="JOB 24:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2"/>Worri hamaan beessisa meessa'aa balleessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:2">isaan hoolee hatane bobbaafatan.<verse eid="JOB 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3"/>Harree ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qannee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">oofatanee deeman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">qotiyyoo haadha hiyyeessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:3">qaddi'iif fudhatan.<verse eid="JOB 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4"/>Isaan hiyyeeyyii karaa irraa hin ari'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">hiyyeeyyiin lafa irraa marti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:4">isaan duraa hin baqatan.<verse eid="JOB 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5"/>Hiyyeeyyiin akka harree diidaa goomolee keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">ijoollee ifiitiif sagalee barbaassa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:5">lafa goomole'ee keessa daddaaqan.<verse eid="JOB 24:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6"/>Isaan fichaa nama dhibi'ii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">okeya hin haammatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">oorruu woyni'ii ta worra hama'aa keessalle'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:6">woxoo qocatan.<verse eid="JOB 24:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7"/>Halkan guutuu qullaa bulan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:7">boojji'iif'ille waan ifi irra buufatanu hin qabanu.<verse eid="JOB 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8"/>Bokkeya gaara irra roobuun hin tortoran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">waan jalatti qophatanu dhabanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:8">rassa'atti maxxananee bulan.<verse eid="JOB 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9"/>Worri hamaan daa'ima abbaa hin qanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">harma irraa butanee garboonfatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:9">daa'ima hiyyeessaa qaddii godhatan.<verse eid="JOB 24:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10"/>Hiyyeeyyiin woyaa malee qullaa ifii deeman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:10">isaan laddee hin ba'atan ammoo hin beelowan.<verse eid="JOB 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11"/>Tarree fichaa worra hamoole'ee oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">zayitii ejersaa hin cunfan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">unkuruura woyni'ii irralle'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">daadhii woyni'ii hin cunfan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:11">isaan ammoo hin dheebotan.<verse eid="JOB 24:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12"/>Qachoota gugurdaa keessaa worri du'u hin aadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">worri madowanelle qarqaaramiisaaf hin iyyan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:12">Waaqi ammoo daadimata isaanii hin caqanne.<verse eid="JOB 24:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13"/>«Worri ifa jibbu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">worri karaa ifaa hin beenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:13">yookiin daandii ifaa irralle hin turre jiran.<verse eid="JOB 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14"/>Nami nama ijjeesu fuullee bari'iitiin ka'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">hiyyeeyyi'ii fi worra rakkate hin ijjeesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:14">halkanille akka hattu'uu hata.<verse eid="JOB 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15"/>Nami gaarayyeeffatu lafa dhiitu eegata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">eennulle akka isa hin dhaggineef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:15">fuula ifii hin hagooggata.<verse eid="JOB 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16"/>Hattuun halkan qottee seenti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">guyyaa ammoo dhokaata oolti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:16">ifaan waan tokkolle godhuu hin barbaaddu.<verse eid="JOB 24:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17"/>Dukkanaan bararassiisi waan isaan gammachiittuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:17">dukkanti dimmi isaaniif ganama.<verse eid="JOB 24:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18"/>«Worri hamaan akka hoomacha bisaan irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">yennaa diqqoo qofaaf mudhatan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:18">Qoodi lafa isaanii ta abaarante waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:18">namuu gara fichaa woynii isaanii hin dhaqu.<verse eid="JOB 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19"/>O'ii fi caami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">dhakaa bokkeyaa ka baqe akkuma balleessu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:19">qileen awwaala jalaalle cubbaaleyyii akkasuma gooti.<verse eid="JOB 24:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20"/>Haadhotiin isaanii isaan hin deeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">corroxxille isaan hin nyaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">namuu isaan hin qaabatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:20">worri hamaan akka mukaa hin caccaba.<verse eid="JOB 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21"/>Isaan dubartii deya hin qanne hin cunqursan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:21">haadha hiyyeessaatiifille waan dansaa hin godhanu.<verse eid="JOB 24:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22"/>Waaqi ammoo hunna ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">worra hunnaameyyii hin balleessa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 24:22">Le'iin isaanii ta tolte fakkaatulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:22">jiruu addachiittu hin qabanu.<verse eid="JOB 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23"/>Waaqi akka isaan nageyaan le'anu lakkisulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:23">karaa isaan deemanu hubatee hin ilaala.<verse eid="JOB 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24"/>Worri hamaan yennaa diqqo'oof hin jajaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">achiin duuba ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">akkuma daraara'aa qooranee hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:24">akka midhaaniille hin haamaman.<verse eid="JOB 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25"/>«Yoo akkas hin te'in</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">ani dharaamessa akka te'ee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">wonni ani dubbadhe sirrii akka hin te'in</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 24:25">ka mirkaneessu eennu ree?» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 24:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Biildaad</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1"/>Achiin duuba Biildaad nami biyya Shu'aa deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 25:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2"/>«Mootumma'aa fi sodaatamuun ta Waaqaa ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:2">inni ol-gubbaa oliititti nageya hin buusa.<verse eid="JOB 25:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3"/>Laakkowamuu dandeettii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:3">Ifi isaa eennu irratti ifuu dhaba ree?<verse eid="JOB 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4"/>Nami attam Waaqa duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">balchaa te'uu dande'a ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 25:4">Nami nama te'ee dhalate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:4">attam qulqulluu te'uu dande'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 25:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5"/>Kunoo, ji'inuu isa duratti akka dansaa hin ifu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:5">urjootille isa duratti qulqullu'uu moti.<verse eid="JOB 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6"/>Ilmi namaa ka akka raammo'oo fa'a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 25:6">attam attam caalaa diqqaata ree!» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 26:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2"/>«Ati nama hunna hin qanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">attam attam qarqaarte!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 26:2">Nama dadhabaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:2">attam attam jabeessite!<verse eid="JOB 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3"/>Ati nama qaroo hin te'in</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">attam attam gorsite!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:3">Beekkumsalle attam attam kenniteef!<verse eid="JOB 26:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4"/>Tana akka dubbattu ka si qarqaare eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:4">Ayyaana eennuutitti afaan keeti keessaa dubbate?<verse eid="JOB 26:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5"/>«Ekeraan abbaaya'aan jalatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:5">rorommiisatti jirti.<verse eid="JOB 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6"/>Addeen worri du'e jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">Waaqa duratti guutumatti mudhatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:6">wonni takkaalle isii hin gollitu.<verse eid="JOB 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7"/>Waaqi gubbaa gara kaabaa addee duwwaa irratti diriirse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:7">lafaalle womaa adoo jala hin jiraatin rarraase.<verse eid="JOB 26:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8"/>Waaqi duumensa keessatti bisaan kipha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:8">duumensille ulfaatiisa bisaaniitiin hin tarsa'u.<verse eid="JOB 26:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9"/>Inni barcumaa mootummaa ifii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:9">duumensa ifii diriirsee hin golla.<verse eid="JOB 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10"/>Waaqi ifaa fi dukkana gargar baasiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:10">bisaan irratti naannessee meessaa godheera.<verse eid="JOB 26:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11"/>Yennaa inni xixu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:11">utubooti ol-gubba'aa soda'aan hin raafaman.<verse eid="JOB 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12"/>Inni hunna ifiitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">abbaayaa hin sarmisiisa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:12">qarummaa ifiitiin bineensa guddaa abbaayaa keessaa ka, ‹Rahaab› jedhamu hin kukkuta.<verse eid="JOB 26:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13"/>Inni hafuura ifiitiin ol-gubbaa qulqulleessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:13">harka ifiitille'een jawwee lowiisatti jirtu woraane.<verse eid="JOB 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14"/>Kun duudiin waan Waaqi huju keessaa diqqo'o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">nuuti hasaassaa isaa qofa dhageenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 26:14">mandiisuu hunna isaa eentu hubatuu dande'a ree?» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 26:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1"/>Ammalle Iyoob dabalee,<verse eid="JOB 27:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2"/>«Dhugaa Waaqa jiraataa waan mara dande'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">ka haqa kiyya na dhooggatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:2">jiruu tiyya natti hadheessee,<verse eid="JOB 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3"/>haga lubbu'uun jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:3">hafuurri Waaqi na keessa keye haga na keessa jiru,<verse eid="JOB 27:3"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4"/>hantuun afaan kiyya keessaa hin baatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:4">arrabi kiyyalle soba hin dubbatu.<verse eid="JOB 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5"/>Ani ijjumaa isiniin sirri'i hin jedhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:5">haga du'a tiyyaatitti yakkaa malee le'uu irraa hin goru.<verse eid="JOB 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6"/>Balchummaa tiyyatti hin jabaadha'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">gad hin lakkisulle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">bara le'ii tiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:6">wodanaan kiyya waan kanatti hin gaabbu.<verse eid="JOB 27:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7"/>«Diinni kiyya akka worra hama'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">worri na mormu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:7">akka worra balchaa hin te'inii te'uu ti.<verse eid="JOB 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8"/>Yennaa Waaqi isaan balleessu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">yennaa inni lubbuu isaan keessaa baasu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">addiin worra Waaqa malee le'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:8">maan te'itti laati?<verse eid="JOB 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9"/>Yennaa rakkinni isaanitti dhufu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:9">Waaqi iyya isaanii hin dhage'aa ree?<verse eid="JOB 27:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10"/>Isaan Waaqa waan mara dande'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">hin gammadanii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:10">Yennaa mara Waaqa hin waammatanii ree?<verse eid="JOB 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11"/>«Ani marroo hunna Waaqaa isin barsiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">karoora Waaqa waan mara dande'uulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:11">ani isin hin dhossu.<verse eid="JOB 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12"/>Isin martinuu tana dhaggitaneertan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:12">eegasuu waan bu'aa hin qanne maaf dubbattan ree?<verse eid="JOB 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13"/>Qoodi nami hamaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">Waaqa irraa dhaggatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">dhaalli nami nama cunqursu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 27:13">Waaqa waan mara dande'u irraa fudhatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:13">ka asii gad jiru:<verse eid="JOB 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14"/>Ijoolleen isaa yoo heddattelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">shallaaga'aan dhumatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:14">sanyiin isaalle sagalee quuttee nyaattu hin qabaattu.<verse eid="JOB 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15"/>Worri baraareen hafe dhukkubaan dhumata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">haadhotiin hiyyeessaa isaaniille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:15">isaaniif hin boottu.<verse eid="JOB 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16"/>Worri hamaan meetii akka biyye'ee tuulee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">woyaalle akkuma faara biyye'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:16">wol irra naquu dande'a fa'a.<verse eid="JOB 27:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17"/>Waan isaan tuulatane san ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">worra balcha'attuu uffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:17">worri yakkaa hin qannelle meetii hin qoqoodaman.<verse eid="JOB 27:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18"/>Manni isaan ijaaranu akka mana saaphuphu'uutii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:18">akka gosee nama midhaan eeguu ti.<verse eid="JOB 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19"/>Worri hamaan dureessa te'ee hin rafa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">ammoo itti hin deebi'anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">yennaa isaan dammaqanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:19">karri isaanii marti baddeerti.<verse eid="JOB 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20"/>Bararaqi akka lola'aa isaan irra yaa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:20">halkan hobonbolattiin isaan fudhattee deenti.<verse eid="JOB 27:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21"/>Qilleensi gara aduun baatuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">isaan fuudhee deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">isaanille hin dhaggamanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:21">addee isaanii irraa haxowee isaan balleessa.<verse eid="JOB 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22"/>Isaan hunna qilleensa sanii jalaa bayiisaaf wodhaananulle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:22">marartii malee bira itti dabara.<verse eid="JOB 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23"/>Qilleensi isaan irratti harka dhowee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 27:23">addee jiru irralle'ee isaanitti siissa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Siissa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lafa tokko tokkotti </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">fiissa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jedhan.</char></note>.<verse eid="JOB 27:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Wolaloo Marroo Qarumma'aa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1"/>«Dhuguma boolli meetii keessaa qotanee baasanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:1">addeen worqii itti baqsiisanu jirti.<verse eid="JOB 28:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2"/>Sibiilli lafa keessaa dhaggama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">sibiilli diimaalle biyyee albuudaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:2">baqisiifamee dhaggama.<verse eid="JOB 28:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3"/>Namooti qilee lafaa keessa seenanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">dukkana dimmaa keessa lixanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:3">biyyee albuudaa barbaadan.<verse eid="JOB 28:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4"/>Isaan lafa nami le'u irraa fagaatanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">addee miilli namaa ijjattee hin beenne geyan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:4">Achitti boolla qilee qotanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">wodaroo irratti rarra'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:4">nama irraa fagaatanee qofuu ifii hujan.<verse eid="JOB 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5"/>Latti midhaan sagalee te'u baattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:5">keessi isi'ii ammoo ibiddaan baqee garagaggala.<verse eid="JOB 28:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6"/>Rassaa isi'ii keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">dhakaan gatii guddo'oo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">ka ‹Safiiros› jedhamu dhaggama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:6">biyyee isi'ii keessalle'ee worqiin hin dhagganti.<verse eid="JOB 28:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7"/>Karaa gara albuudaa geessu san risaan hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:7">ilti jajju'uulle hin dhaggine.<verse eid="JOB 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8"/>Bineensi hamaan addee san hin ijjanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:8">neenqille karaa san hin dabarre.<verse eid="JOB 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9"/>Harki nama albuuda qotuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">rassaa jabaa hin caccassa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:9">gaarotalle hundee irraa garaggaggalcha.<verse eid="JOB 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10"/>Isaan rassaa dhoosanee karaa hin baasan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:10">ilti isaaniille waan gatii guddo'oo hin dhaggiti.<verse eid="JOB 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11"/>Madda lagaa hin kiphan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:11">waan lafa keessatti dhokatelle ifatti hin baasan.<verse eid="JOB 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12"/>«Ammoo qarummaan eessatti dhagganti?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:12">Addeen hubanti'ii eessa jirti?<verse eid="JOB 28:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13"/>Qarummaan lafa nami le'u keessatti hin dhaggantu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:13">namille gatii isi'ii hin beeku.<verse eid="JOB 28:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14"/>Qileen abbaaya'aa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">‹Qarummaan na keessa hin jirtu› jetti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:14">abbaayaalle, ‹Qarummaan na bira hin jirtu› jetti.<verse eid="JOB 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15"/>Qarummaan worqii qullu'uun hin bitantu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:15">gatiin isi'iille meeti'iin hin madaalantu.<verse eid="JOB 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16"/>Gatiin isi'ii worqii gatii guddo'ootiin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">dhakaa ‹Sardoniikis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sardoniikis: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dhakaa gatii guddoo qabu.</char></note>› jedhamuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:16">yookiin dhakaa, ‹Safiiros› jedhamuun wol hin qixxawu.<verse eid="JOB 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17"/>Worqi'ii fi daaw'itiille'een<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Daaw'itii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bara durii gatiin daaw'iti'ii akka malee guddo'o.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">wol hin qixxoottu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:17">Dooqa worqii qullu'uulle'een</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:17">hin jijjiirantu.<verse eid="JOB 28:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18"/>Gatiin qarumma'aa dooqa gatii guddo'ootii fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">dhakaa gatii gudda'ootiin wol hin qixxoottu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:18">elellaan diintuulle<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Elellaan diintuu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bara durii elellaan gatii guddoo qaddi</char></note> caalti.<verse eid="JOB 28:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19"/>Qarummaan dhakaa gatii guddo'oo ka Itoophiya'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Itoophiyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yaadannoo Dad. 2:13 irratti kenname ilaali.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">ka ‹Xophaaziyon› jedhamuun wol hin qixxoottu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:19">worqii qulluu gatii guddo'oolle'een wol hin qixxoottu.<verse eid="JOB 28:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20"/>«Eegasuu qarummaan eessaa dhutti ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 28:20">Addeen hubantiin jirtu eessa ree?<verse eid="JOB 28:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21"/>Isiin ila dada maraa duraa dhokatteerti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:21">sinbirrootaayyuu dhokatteerti.<verse eid="JOB 28:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22"/>Badi'ii fi duuti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">‹Nuuti oduu isi'ii qofa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:22">gurra keennaan dhageenne› jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 28:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23"/>Waaqi karaa gara qarumma'aa geessu hin hubata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:23">addee isiin jirtulle isa qofattuu beeka.<verse eid="JOB 28:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24"/>Inni qaccee lafaa duudii waan dhagguuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:24">waan ol-gubba'aan jala jiru mara dhagga.<verse eid="JOB 28:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25"/>Waaqi yennaa qilleensaaf hunna kenne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:25">haga bisaaniille yennaa mike<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:25 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mike: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wodaro'oon yookiin ciqile'een haga waan tokkoo beekiisaaf laakkowiisa.</char></note>,<verse eid="JOB 28:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26"/>Bokkeyaaf seera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:26">balaqqeetti'iifille karaa yennaa baase,<verse eid="JOB 28:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27"/>achiin duuba qarummaa ilaalee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">gatii isi'ii murteesse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:27">inni isii qorqoree jabeessee isii dhaabe.<verse eid="JOB 28:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28"/>Achiin duuba inni namaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">‹Kunoo, Mootii Waan Maraa sodaatiis qarumma'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 28:28">waan hantuu irraa goriisille hubanti'i› jedhe» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 28:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Dubbii Iyoobii Ta Dhumarraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1"/>Iyoob ammalle dubbatee,<verse eid="JOB 29:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2"/>«Le'iin tiyya ta ammaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">ta akka yennaa Waaqi dur na eegee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:2">adoo teete ani attam fedhaayyu!<verse eid="JOB 29:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3"/>Yennaa ifi isaa mataa kiyya irratti ife,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:3">dukkana keessa ani ifa isaatiin ideeme.<verse eid="JOB 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4"/>Yennaa bara qananummaa tiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">yennaa eeddoon Waaqaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:4">dunkaana tiyya irra jirtu,<verse eid="JOB 29:4"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5"/>yennaa Waaqi waan mara dande'u na woliin jiru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:5">yennaa ijoolleen tiyya na marsiteertu,<verse eid="JOB 29:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6"/>yennaa ani aananiin miila kiyya dhiqadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:6">yennaa rassaan zayitii ejersaa naaf madde,<verse eid="JOB 29:6"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7"/>yennaa ani gara seensuma karra qacha'aa dhaqe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:7">yennaa ani addee wolgeyi'ii san tee'e,<verse eid="JOB 29:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8"/>dargaggooti na dhagganee karaa irraa gorane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:8">jaarsoleelle kaatee dhaabbatte.<verse eid="JOB 29:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9"/>Sooreyyiin kolba'aalle dubbatuu lakkittee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:9">afaan qabatte.<verse eid="JOB 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10"/>Qoonqoon qondaaltotaa cadhittee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:10">arrabi isaaniille laagadaa isaaniititti maxxane.<verse eid="JOB 29:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11"/>Ka na dhage'e duudiin na jaje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:11">ka na dhaggelle duudiin na galateeffate.<verse eid="JOB 29:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12"/>Sababille ani worra hiyyeeyyii iyyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">rakkoo jalaa baasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:12">ijoollee abba'aa fi haadha hin qannelle qarqaareera.<verse eid="JOB 29:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13"/>Worri du'iisaaf dhikaate na eebbiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">qarqaarsi ani godhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:13">gadhaa haadhotii hiyyeessaa gammachiiseera.<verse eid="JOB 29:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14"/>Ani balchummaa akka woya'aa uffadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">muraa dhuga'aalle akka geella'aa uffadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:14">akka marata mata'aalle maradhe.<verse eid="JOB 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15"/>Ani worra balla'aaf ila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:15">worra naafafille miila te'eeraayyu.<verse eid="JOB 29:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16"/>Ani hiyyeeyyi'iif akka abba'aa te'ee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:16">alaga'aafille wobii te'eeraayyu.<verse eid="JOB 29:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17"/>Ani a'oo nama hama'aa cassee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:17">waan inni butatelle afaan isaa irraa buuseera.<verse eid="JOB 29:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18"/>«Achiin duuba ani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">‹Barri kiyya akka maansaa bacatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:18">manuma kiyya keessatti hin du'a.<verse eid="JOB 29:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19"/>Ani akka muka hidda gara bisaanii yaafatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:19">halkan guutuulle fixeensi damee isaa irra jiruu ti.<verse eid="JOB 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20"/>Ulfinni kiyya yennaa mara haareya te'ee hin jiraata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:20">Hunni tiyyalle yennaa mara guubee haareya› jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 29:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21"/>«Namooti miidhassanee na caqasane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:21">gorsa kiyyalle dhage'iisaaf cadhisane.<verse eid="JOB 29:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22"/>Ani dubbadheen duuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">isaan deebi'anee hin dubbanne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:22">dubbiin tiyya gurra isaaniititti coxxe.<verse eid="JOB 29:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23"/>Isaan akka nama bokkeya eegatuu na eegatane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">akka nama bokkeya furmaataa eegatuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:23">afaan ifii bananee dubbii tiyya eegatan.<verse eid="JOB 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24"/>Yennaa isaan ifi addii dhabane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ani isaanitti seeqadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:24">ifi fuula kiyyaalle isaan jajjabeesse.<verse eid="JOB 29:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25"/>Ani karaa isaaniif filee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">bulchaa isaaniif te'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">Akka mooticha loltoota ifii odduu le'uu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">odduu isaanii le'e.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 29:25">Akka nama worra gadde jajjabeessuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 29:25">isaan jajjabeesse.<verse eid="JOB 29:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1"/>«Amma ammoo worri gannaan anaa gadii natti murga;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">ani abbootii isaanii saree tika hoolee tiyyaa eeddu woliinuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:1">akka hin teenneef ta tuffadheeru.<verse eid="JOB 30:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2"/>Hunni isaanii waan dhumatteertuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:2">maan naa bayan?<verse eid="JOB 30:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3"/>Dhabaa fi beela irraa ta kaate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">goomolee nami keessa hin leene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:3">lafa godduu keessa halkaniin daaqane.<verse eid="JOB 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4"/>Isaan baala goomole'ee ka kuraawu guuratane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:4">hidda muka hadhowuulle nyaatane.<verse eid="JOB 30:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5"/>Isaan kolbaa keessaa ari'amane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:5">akkuma hattu'utti iyyanu namooti isaanitti iyyane.<verse eid="JOB 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6"/>Goda bowwaa keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">rassaa oddu'uu fi boolla lafa jalaa keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:6">le'iis dirqama itti teete.<verse eid="JOB 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7"/>Isaan odduu tuse'eetii akka harre'ee baroodane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:7">badda jalalle'etti wolitti qabamane.<verse eid="JOB 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8"/>Isaan worra bu'aa hin qanne, ka maqaa badee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:8">lafa irraa ari'ame.<verse eid="JOB 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9"/>«Isaan sirbaan natti murgan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:9">odduu isaaniitille'etti ka mammaassaa te'eera.<verse eid="JOB 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10"/>Isaan na jibbanee na irraa fagaatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:10">itti qaanii malee fuula kiyyatti tufan.<verse eid="JOB 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11"/>Waaqi hunna tiyya laaffisee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">waan gad na qabeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">akka farda bixaalli irraa bu'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:11">waan fedhane na godhane.<verse eid="JOB 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12"/>Gara midda kiyyaatiin worri nama jeequ ka'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">isaan miila kiyyaaf tiyyoo afanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:12">badii naaf qopheessane.<verse eid="JOB 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13"/>Isaan karaa natti cufanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">na balleessiisa barbaadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:13">nami na qarqaarulle hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14"/>Isaan akka lola'aa dalleya kiyya uranee seenane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:14">waan mara caccassaa natti dhufane.<verse eid="JOB 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15"/>Ani guddoo sodaadheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">ulfinni kiyya akka waan qilleensi fudhateetitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">na irraa haxowameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:15">fayyinni kiyya akka duumensaa dabareera.<verse eid="JOB 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16"/>«Amma lubbuun tiyya na keessaa bayaarti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:16">guyyooti farraalle na qabataneeran.<verse eid="JOB 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17"/>Halkan lafeen tiyya na bocci;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:17">dhukkubiin na boccu foora naa hin kennitu.<verse eid="JOB 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18"/>Waaqi hunna ifii guddo'oon</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">woyaa tiyya shuntuurachiiseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:18">akka woyaa morma dhipho'oo na hudheera.<verse eid="JOB 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19"/>Waaqi dhoqqee keessatti na gate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:19">anille akka buku'uutii fi daadha'a te'e.<verse eid="JOB 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20"/>«Ee Waaqa, ani si waammadhe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">ati ammoo naaf hin deebinne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:20">Ani dhaabbadhee gara keeti daadimadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:20">ati ammoo cadhittee na ilaalte.<verse eid="JOB 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21"/>Ati gadhaa natti jabaattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:21">hunna teeti guddo'oon na miite.<verse eid="JOB 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22"/>Ati ol na fuutee qilleensa irra teessitte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:22">bubbee keessa asii fi achi na hafarsite.<verse eid="JOB 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23"/>Gara du'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">addee worri jiru duudiin du'ee itti galutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:23">akka ati na geessitu ani hin beeka.<verse eid="JOB 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24"/>«Ani akka mana jigee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">eentu deebisee na ijaara ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">Adoo ani ijjumaa jigee hin badin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:24">Waaqi deebisee na hin ijaaruu ree?<verse eid="JOB 30:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25"/>Ani worra rakkateef hin boonnee ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:25">Worra hiyyeeyyi'iifille hin gaddinee ree?<verse eid="JOB 30:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26"/>Yennaa ani waan dansaa barbaadu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">wonni hantuun natti dhutte.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 30:26">Yennaa ani ifa eegadhulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:26">dukkanti natti dhutte.<verse eid="JOB 30:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27"/>Keessi kiyya raafamee nageya dhabe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:27">guyyuma guyya'aan rakkadhe.<verse eid="JOB 30:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28"/>Nafi adu'uun adoo hin te'in</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">gaddaan gurraachowee deema;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">yaa'ii keessatti dhaabbadhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:28">qarqaarsaaf iyya.<verse eid="JOB 30:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29"/>Ani namaan adda bayee jeedalaaf obboleessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:29">guchi'iif jaala te'eera.<verse eid="JOB 30:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30"/>Gogaan nafa kiyyaa gurraachowee solloqqoye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:30">lafeen tiyyalle o'aan gubatte.<verse eid="JOB 30:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31"/>Kiraarri kiyya guddichi bowaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 30:31">suusulleen tiyyalle worwaanataaf teete.<verse eid="JOB 30:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1"/>«Ani ila halcha'aatiin gara durraa akka hin ilaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:1">ila tiyya woliin gondooroo gondooradheera.<verse eid="JOB 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2"/>Gubbaa irraa Waaqa biraa qoodi namaa maan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:2">Ka waan mara dande'u ka addee oli aantuu jiru biraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:2">dhaalli namaa maan?<verse eid="JOB 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3"/>Balaan worra hama'aaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:3">badiin worra dokonkora hujuufii motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4"/>Waaqi karaa kiyya hin dhagguu ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:4">Tarkaaffii tiyya duudiille hin laakkowuu ree?<verse eid="JOB 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5"/>«Sobaan yoo deemee jiraadhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:5">miilli kiyya sobiisaaf yoo ariifatee jiraate,<verse eid="JOB 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6"/>akka ani komii hin qanne akka beeku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:6">Waaqi kiiloo sirri'iitiin na madaaluu ti.<verse eid="JOB 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7"/>Faanti tiyya karaa irraa yoo gortee jiraatte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">gadhaan kiyya waan ilti tiyya dhaggitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">yoo hordofee jiraate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:7">harki kiyyalle cubbu'uun yoo battowee jiraate,<verse eid="JOB 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8"/>waan ani facaase nami dhibiin nyaatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:8">midhaan kiyya duudiille buqqa'ee baduu ti.<verse eid="JOB 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9"/>«Gadhaan kiyya dubarti'iin sossobamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">balbala ollaa kiyyaa duratti riphee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:9">haadha manaa isaa eegadhee yoo jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10"/>haati manaa tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">nama dhibi'iif midhaan daattuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:10">nami dhibiille isii woliin rafuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11"/>Wonni kun yakkaa guddoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:11">seera duratti adabbii namatti fiddu.<verse eid="JOB 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12"/>Cubbuun tun akka ibiddaa guddee balleessiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">ani adoo tana godhee jiraadhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:12">karra tiyya mara hin balleessitiiyyu.<verse eid="JOB 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13"/>«Tajaajiltooti tiyya ta dhiiraatii fi ta durraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">natti iyyatanuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:13">iyyata isaanii dhage'iisa yoo dhabee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14"/>yennaa Waaqi mura'aaf ka'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">ani maan godhu'uu jira ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:14">Yennaa inni na gaafatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:14">ani maan deebisu'uu jira ree?<verse eid="JOB 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15"/>Gadaamessa haadha tiyyaa keessatti na dadee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">tajaajiltoota tiyyalle ka dade isaa motii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">Nu mara gadaamessa keessatti ka dade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:15">isumaa motii ree?<verse eid="JOB 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16"/>«Waan Hiyyeeyyiin halchite</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">ijjumaa dhooggadhee hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:16">haadhotii hiyyeessaalle jajjabeessiisa hin lakkinne.<verse eid="JOB 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17"/>Ijoollee haadhaa fi abbaa hin qanne beelottuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:17">sagalee tiyya qofi hin nyaanne.<verse eid="JOB 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18"/>Ammoo dargaggummaa tiyyaa jalqabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">akka abba'aa isaaniif te'eera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">bara jiruu tiyyaa mara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:18">haadhotii hiyyeessaa qarqaareera.<verse eid="JOB 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19"/>Nama daare tokko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:19">yookiin hiyyeessa qullaa jiru tokko dhaggee,<verse eid="JOB 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20"/>woyaa rifeensa hoolee tiyyaa irraa hujante,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">itti uffiseeruun o'ifatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:20">yennaan inni na hin eebbisin hin jirtu.<verse eid="JOB 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21"/>Kora mura'aa duratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">fudhatama dhaggatiisa kiyya beekee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">ijoollee hadhaa fi abbaa hin qanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:21">yoo miidhee jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22"/>harki kiyya gurmuu tiyya irra buqqa'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:22">mitikaan harka kiyyaalle caccabu.<verse eid="JOB 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23"/>Badii Waaqi na irratti fidu waan sodaadheef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">sodaachisuu arnya isaa irraa ta kaate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:23">waan akkasii godhuu hin dandeenne.<verse eid="JOB 31:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24"/>«Ani worqi'itti addii godhadhee hin beeku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:24">yookiin worqii qulluulle'etti hin addanne.<verse eid="JOB 31:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25"/>Karri tiyya guddoo waan teeteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">yookiin durummaan tiyya waan bacatteef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:25">gammadee yoo jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26"/>ifa adu'uu, yookiin ji'a ulfinnaan deemu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:26">ilaalee yoo jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27"/>gadhaan kiyya dhossa'aan sobamee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">ifa adu'uutii fi dansummaa ji'aatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">harka kiyya sunqatiisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:27">isaan waaqonfadhee yoo jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28"/>ani Waaqa ol-aana'aaf addatamuu waan dhabeef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:28">tun cubbuu du'a namatti mursiittu.<verse eid="JOB 31:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29"/>«Ani badii worra na jibbuutitti hin ilillinne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">hantuun yennaa isaan dhaqqaddelle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:29">ani hin gammanne.<verse eid="JOB 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30"/>Jiruun diina kiyyaa akka baddu abaaree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:30">afaan kiyya cubbuu akka dubbatu hin goone.<verse eid="JOB 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31"/>Nami mana kiyyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">‹Sagalee isaa nyaatee ka hin quufin eentu jira?›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:31">jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32"/>Ani worra karaa deemuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">balbala tiyya waan baneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:32">keessummaan karaa keessa hin bulle.<verse eid="JOB 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33"/>Ani yakkaa tiyya gadhaa kiyya keessatti dhoffadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:33">akka worra dhibi'ii cubbuu tiyya hin gollanne.<verse eid="JOB 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34"/>Kolbaa bindillaa sodaatiisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">tuffiin maati'ii na bararassitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">mana keessaa adoo hin bayin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:34">cadhisee mana keessa hin teenne.<verse eid="JOB 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35"/>«Maalo'o, nama naa dhage'u adoo qabaadhe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Akka dhugaa dubbadhe mudhisiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">mallattoon tiyya kunoo ti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 31:35">Waaqi waan mara dande'u naaf deebisuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">Ka na himatu himata ifii tarre'een barreeffatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:35">adoo hin dhikeeffatuu!<verse eid="JOB 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36"/>Silaa ani dhugumaan himata san</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">gurmuu tiyya irratti hin kaafadhaayyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:36">akka kallachaalle mataa kiyya irratti hin keyadhaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37"/>Ani laakkossa tarkaaffii tiyyaa duudii isatti hima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:37">akka sooressa guddaa tokkoolle isatti dhikaadha.<verse eid="JOB 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38"/>«Worra lafa qabu cunqursee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:38">lafa isaaniille hunnaan fudhadhee qotee yoo jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:38"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39"/>midhaan isaanii kaffaltii malee nyaadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:39">akka isaan du'anu godhee yoo jiraadhe,<verse eid="JOB 31:39"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40"/>lafa san irratti addee qamadi'ii qoreen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 31:40">addee garbu'uu jigidaan ajowu latuu ti» jedhe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Dubbiin Iyoobii as irratti dhumatte.<verse eid="JOB 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Eliihuun Jaalota Iyoobii Xixe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="JOB 32:1-37:24">32:1—37:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1"/>Iyoob, «Ani nama balcha'a» waan ifiin jedheef, jarri tun sadiin deebii isaaf deebisuu lakkisane.<verse eid="JOB 32:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2"/>Eliihuun ilmi Baaraakelii Buzichaa ka maatii Raamii te'e, sababa Iyoob Waaqa caalaa ifi balchoonseef guddoo aare. <verse eid="JOB 32:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3"/>Jaaloti Iyoobii sadiin deebii quussitu Iyoobiif waan hin deebisiiniif, deebiin isaanii tun akka Waaqi dokonkora hujeeru waan gooteef, Eliihuun isaan irralle'etti aare. <verse eid="JOB 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4"/>Isaan duudiin angafoota isaa waan te'aneef, haga isaan dubbatanee fixatanutti, Eliihuun Iyoobitti dubbatiisaaf eegateeyyu. <verse eid="JOB 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5"/>Afaan jara sadiinii tana keessa deebiin akka hin jirre yennaa dhagge, Eliihuun aare.<verse eid="JOB 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6"/>Maarre Eliihuun ilmi Baaraakelii Buzichaa deebisee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 32:6">«Ani ijoolle'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">isin nama gugurda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:6">tanaaf sodaadhee waan beeku himiisaaf isinitti hin gamne.<verse eid="JOB 32:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7"/>Ani, ‹Nami gugurdaan qara dubbatuu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:7">qarummaa bara heddu'utti dhaggatane barsiisanuu ti› jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8"/>Ammoo ka nama keessa bulee hubantii namaaf kennu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:8">ayyaana Waaqa waan mara dande'uu ti.<verse eid="JOB 32:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9"/>Qarummaan guddatane'eefii moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:9">waan sirrii te'e hubatiisille dulloomane'eefii moti.<verse eid="JOB 32:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10"/>«Tanaaf na caqasa'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:10">anille waan beeku isinitti hima.<verse eid="JOB 32:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11"/>Kunoo, ani haga isin dubbatanee fixxanu eegadhe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">jechoota filataa yennaa dubbattanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:11">miidhassee caqase.<verse eid="JOB 32:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12"/>Ani akka dansaa isin caqase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">ammoo isin keessaa nami tokkolle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">balleessaa Iyoobii mirkaneessee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:12">dubbii isaatiif deebii ka kenne hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13"/>Isin, ‹Nuuti qarummaa dhagganneerra;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">ka Iyoobiif deebii kennu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:13">Waaqa malee namaa moti› hin jedhina'a.<verse eid="JOB 32:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14"/>Iyoob isin morme malee na hin mormine;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:14">anille moromaa akka keessaniitiin isaaf hin deebisu.<verse eid="JOB 32:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15"/>«Isaan rifatanee waan deebisanu dhabanee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:15">dubbiin isaan duraa badde.<verse eid="JOB 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16"/>Kunoo, sababa isaan hin dubbanneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">waan isaan deebii deebisanu dhabanee dhaabbataneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:16">ani isaan eeguu qabaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17"/>Anille deebii tiyya hin deebisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:17">waan beekulle hin mudhisa.<verse eid="JOB 32:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18"/>Ani waan dubbadhu hedduu waan qabuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:18">cadhisuu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 32:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19"/>Keessi kiyya daadhii woyni'ii ta cuqqaalantee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">akka qalqalluu daadhii woyni'ii haareyaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:19">ka dho'iisa geyee ti.<verse eid="JOB 32:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20"/>Akka furadhuuf dubbatuu qaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:20">afaan kiyya banadhee deebii kennuu qaba.<verse eid="JOB 32:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21"/>Ani nama tokkoofille hin rogu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:21">nama tokkolle hin kukuulu.<verse eid="JOB 32:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22"/>Ani nama kukuuliisa waan hin beenneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 32:22">silaa ka na dade dafee na balleessaayyu.<verse eid="JOB 32:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1"/>«Iyoob, ammalle waan jedhu dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:1">dubbii tiyya duudiille caqasi.<verse eid="JOB 33:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2"/>Ani afaan kiyya saaqadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:2">arrabi kiyya dubbatiisaaf qophoweera.<verse eid="JOB 33:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3"/>Dubbiin tiyya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">qajeelummaa gadhaa kiyyaa irraa dhutti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:3">arrabi kiyyalle dhugaa dubbata.<verse eid="JOB 33:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4"/>Ayyaanni Waaqaa na dade;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">hafuurri Waaqa waan mara dande'uu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:4">jiruu naa kenne.<verse eid="JOB 33:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5"/>Yoo dandeette deebii naa kenni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">waan dubbattu qopheeffadhuutii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:5">na dura dhaabbadhu.<verse eid="JOB 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6"/>Kunoo, ani Waaqa duratti akkuma keeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:6">nuuti lamaanuu faara irraa dadanne.<verse eid="JOB 33:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7"/>Na sodaatiis si hin bararassin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:7">harki kiyyalle si hin cunqursu.<verse eid="JOB 33:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8"/>«Dhuguma ani si dhage'aaruun dubbatteerta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:8">jecha afaan keeti keessaa bayelle dhage'eera.<verse eid="JOB 33:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9"/>Ati yennaa dubbattu, ‹Ani qulqullu'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">cubbuulle hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">ani qullu'u,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:9">yakkaalle hin qabu.<verse eid="JOB 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10"/>Waaqi na adabiisaaf sababa na irratti barbaada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:10">akka diina ifiille na laakkowa.<verse eid="JOB 33:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11"/>Inni miila kiyya jirma odduu galchee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:11">tarkaaffii tiyya duudii eega› jetta.<verse eid="JOB 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12"/>«Waaqi nama duudii waan caaluuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">ani ammoo tana irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:12">akka ati sirrii hin te'in sitti hima.<verse eid="JOB 33:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13"/>Ati, ‹Waaqi iyyata namaa hin dhage'u› jettee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:13">maaf isa aalatta?<verse eid="JOB 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14"/>Nami hin hubatu malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:14">Waaqi karaa adda addaatiin dubbata.<verse eid="JOB 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15"/>Namooti taqee ifii irra rafaneeranuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">hirriibi hamaan isaan yennaa qabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:15">Waaqi oojju'uun, mudhii halkaniitiin dubbata.<verse eid="JOB 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16"/>Yennaa san inni gurra isaaniititti hin dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:16">ifi eeggachiisiisalle'een isaan bararassa.<verse eid="JOB 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17"/>Akka kanaan hujii hantuu irraa isaan deebisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:17">akka hin koorrelle isaan eega.<verse eid="JOB 33:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18"/>Lubbuu isaanii boolla irraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:18">jiruu isaaniille badii shallaaga'aa irraa hin hambura.<verse eid="JOB 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19"/>Yookiin akka nami taqee ifii gubba'atti dhukkubaan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">dhukkuba hamaa ka yennaa mara lafee isaa bocuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:19">akka adabamu hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 33:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20"/>Maarre jiruun isaa waan nyaataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:20">gadhaan isaalle sagalee guddoo dansa'aayyuu hin diqata.<verse eid="JOB 33:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21"/>Foon isaa dhumatee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:21">lafeen isaa ta dur hin mudhanne yaatee mudhatti.<verse eid="JOB 33:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22"/>Lubbuun isaa gara boollaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:22">jiruun isaa gara ergantoota du'aa dhikaatteerti.<verse eid="JOB 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23"/>«Karaa sirri'ii ka namaaf mudhisanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">ergantoota Waaqaa kuma keessaa tokkochi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:23">gara isaa dhufee isa hin qarqaara fa'a te'a.<verse eid="JOB 33:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24"/>Ergamaan Waaqaalle isaaf mararee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">‹Ani wodoo isaaf dhaggeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:24">akka inni gara boollaa gad hin buune godhi› jedhee du'a ajaja.<verse eid="JOB 33:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25"/>Achiin duuba nafi isaa deebi'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">akka nafa ijoolle'ee haareffama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:25">akka yennaa dargaggumma'aalle te'a.<verse eid="JOB 33:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26"/>Inni Waaqa daadimata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">daadimata isaalle Waaqi hin dhage'a.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 33:26">Inni fuula Waaqaa dhaggee hin ilillisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">Waaqille gara addee balchummaa isaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:26">isa hin deebisa.<verse eid="JOB 33:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27"/>Innille namoota duratti faarfataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">‹Ani cubbuu hujeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">waan sirrii te'e daddasseera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:27">Waaqi ammoo yakkaa tiyya natti hin laakkonne.<verse eid="JOB 33:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28"/>Inni lubbuun tiyya gara boolla awwaalaa akka hin buune wodeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:28">jiruun tiyyalle ifa hin dhaggiti› jedha.<verse eid="JOB 33:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29"/>«Kunoo, Waaqi deddeebisee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:29">tana mara namaaf hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 33:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30"/>Inni ifa jiru'uu akka dhagguuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:30">lubbuu namaa deebisee boolla keessaa hin baasa.<verse eid="JOB 33:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31"/>«Iyoob, waan ani sitti himu akka dansaa caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:31">ani hin dubbadha, ati cadhis.<verse eid="JOB 33:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32"/>Waan jettu yoo qabaatte naa deebis,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:32">ani waan bilisa si baasuuf dubbadhu.<verse eid="JOB 33:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33"/>Yoo waan jettu hin qabaatin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">cadhisii na caqasi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 33:33">anille qarummaa si barsiisa» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 33:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1"/>Eliihuun ammalle dubbatee,<verse eid="JOB 34:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2"/>«Isin namoota qaro'o,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">dubbii tiyya dhage'a'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:2">isin worri beekkoleen na caqasa'a.<verse eid="JOB 34:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3"/>Akkuma arrabi mi'aa sagale'ee beeku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:3">gurrille mi'aa dubbi'ii beeka.<verse eid="JOB 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4"/>Kowa'a waan sirrii te'e filanna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:4">waan dansaalle woliin baranna.<verse eid="JOB 34:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5"/>«Iyoob ifiin, ‹Ani yakkaa hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:5">Waaqi ammoo haqa na dhooggate.<verse eid="JOB 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6"/>Ani adoo dhugaa irra jiruu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">akka dharaamessaa laakkowame;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">adoo yakkaa hin qabaatin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:6">madaa hin fayyineen farriisatti jira› jedheera.<verse eid="JOB 34:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7"/>Nama attamiititti akka Iyoobii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:7">murgoo akka bisaanii una ree?<verse eid="JOB 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8"/>Inni worra hantuu godhu woliin jaaloma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:8">worra hamaaleyyii wolille'een oola.<verse eid="JOB 34:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9"/>Inni, ‹Waaqa gammachiisuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:9">womaa namaaf hin baatu› jedha.<verse eid="JOB 34:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10"/>«Tanaaf isin worri hubattanu na caqasa'a!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Hantuu godhiis Waaqa irraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">dokonkora hujiisille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:10">Waaqa waan mara dande'u irraa fagaatuu ti.<verse eid="JOB 34:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11"/>Waaqi akka hujii namaatitti namaaf hin kaffala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">akkuma ideensa isaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:11">akka inni dhaggatu hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12"/>Waaqi waan mara dande'u hantuu hin huju;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:12">inni haqa hin dassu.<verse eid="JOB 34:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13"/>Lafa irratti eentu ajajaa isa godhe?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">Biyya lafaa duudii irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:13">eentu itti gaafatamaa isa godhe?<verse eid="JOB 34:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14"/>Waaqi ayyaana ifii deebisee yoo fudhate,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:14">hafuura ifiille gara ifii yoo deebifate,<verse eid="JOB 34:14"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15"/>sanyiin namaa duudiin adduma tokko baddee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:15">gara biyye'ee deebiti.<verse eid="JOB 34:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16"/>«Nama hubatu yoo teete tana dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:16">waan ani jedhulle caqasi.<verse eid="JOB 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17"/>Nami haqa jibbu bulchuu dande'aa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">Ati Waaqa! Balchichaa fi hunnaamessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:17">yakkaa itti murtaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 34:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18"/>Mootichaan, ‹Ati woy hin baatu›,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">qondaaltotaan, ‹Isin worra hamaaleyyi'ii›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:18">ka jedhu eennu?<verse eid="JOB 34:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19"/>Isaan duudiin hujii harka isaa waan te'aneef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">inni qondaaltotaaf hin rogu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:19">dureessa hiyyeessa irra caalchisee hin ilaalu.<verse eid="JOB 34:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20"/>Namooti halkan wodhakkaa dedhuma du'uu dande'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">kolbaan raafantee dhumatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">worri hunnaameyyiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:20">harki namaalle adoo isaan hin tuqin hin badan.<verse eid="JOB 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21"/>«Ilti Waaqaa ideensa namaa ilaalti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:21">inni tarkaaffii nama tokko tokkoolle hin dhagga.<verse eid="JOB 34:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22"/>Dimimmis yookiin dukkanti dimmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:22">addeen worri hantuu huju itti dhokatu hin jirtu.<verse eid="JOB 34:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23"/>Waaqi fuula isaa duratti mura'aaf akka dhikaatanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:23">beellama hin qabatu.<verse eid="JOB 34:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24"/>Inni qorqortii malee hunnaameyyii baallii irraa kaasee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:24">worra dhibii addee isaanii buusa.<verse eid="JOB 34:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25"/>Inni hujii isaanii mara waan beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:25">halkan tokkotti baallii irraa isaan kaasee balleessa.<verse eid="JOB 34:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26"/>Inni addee nami duudiin dhaggutti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:26">hammeenna isaaniitiif isaan adaba.<verse eid="JOB 34:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27"/>Sababa isaan isa hordofuu lakkisanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:27">isaaf ajajamuu dhabaneef inni tana godhe.<verse eid="JOB 34:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28"/>Iyyi worra hiyyeeyyi'ii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">gara Waaqaa akka dhaxxu godhaneeran;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:28">Waaqille iyya isaanii dhage'eera.<verse eid="JOB 34:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29"/>Yoo inni cadhise ammoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">eentu isatti mura;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">yoo inni fuula ifii dhoffate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">eentu isa dhagguu dande'a ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:29">Inni nama irratti, gosa biyya adda addaa irralle'etti,<verse eid="JOB 34:29"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30"/>worra kolbaa gowwisiisanu keessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">nama Waaqa malee jiraatu tokko mootii yoo godhe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:30">eentu isa dhoogga ree?.<verse eid="JOB 34:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31"/>«Nami tokko Waaqaan, ‹Ani yakkaamessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:31">ammoo deebi'ee hin yakku.<verse eid="JOB 34:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32"/>Waan ani hin dhaggine ati na barsiisi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:32">yoo yakkee jiraadhe deebi'ee hin yakku› jedhe jiraa ree?.<verse eid="JOB 34:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33"/>Ati cubbuu irraa deebi'iisa didataartuun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">Waaqi akka yaada keetii deebisaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 34:33">San sittuu filata malee anaa moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:33">tanaaf waan beettu natti himi.<verse eid="JOB 34:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34"/>«Worri hubatuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:34">worri qaroon na dhage'ulle anaan,<verse eid="JOB 34:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35"/>‹Iyoob beekkumsa malee dubbata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:35">dubbiin isaalle ta gatii hin qanne› hin jedhan.<verse eid="JOB 34:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36"/>Deebiin Iyoobii ta akka worra hamootaa waan teeteef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">Inni haga dhumaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:36">qoramee adoo hin ilaallamuu!<verse eid="JOB 34:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37"/>Inni cubbuu ifii irratti finqila ede'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">inni odduu teenna tee'ee tuffi'iin harka dhowaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 34:37">dubbii moromaa ifii Waaqa irratti fakkansa» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 34:37"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1"/>Eliihuun itti dabalee,<verse eid="JOB 35:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2"/>«Iyoobiin ati, ‹Waaqa duratti ani balcha'a›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:2">jechuun keeti sirri'ii?<verse eid="JOB 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3"/>Ati Waaqaan, ‹Ani cubbuu yoo hujuu dhabe ati maan dhaggatta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:3">Ani bu'aa maan dhaggadha ree?› jette.<verse eid="JOB 35:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4"/>«Amma ani si'ii fi jaalota teetii ta si woliin jirtuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:4">deebii hin kenna.<verse eid="JOB 35:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5"/>Ol jedhii gara ol-gubba'aa ilaal!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:5">Duumensa si'iin gubba'atti mudhatu hubadhu.<verse eid="JOB 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6"/>Ati cubbuu yoo hujje Waaqa maaniin miita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:6">Balleessaan teeti yoo bacatte maan isa goota?<verse eid="JOB 35:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7"/>Ati balchaa yoo teete isaaf maan kennita?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:7">Yookiin inni harka keeti irraa maan fudhata?<verse eid="JOB 35:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8"/>Hammeenni keeti nama akka keetii hin miidha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:8">balchummaan teetille ilmaan namaa calla'aaf bu'aa qaddi.<verse eid="JOB 35:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9"/>«Sababa cunqurfamiisi bacateef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">kolbaan hin iyyiti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">harka hunnaamessaa jalaa bayiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:9">qarqaarsa dhaggatiisaaf iyyatan.<verse eid="JOB 35:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10"/>Ammoo eennulle, ‹Waaqi na dade,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">yennaa rakkoo guddo'oo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:10">nami akka isa faarfatu ka godhu,<verse eid="JOB 35:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11"/>ka bineensota lafaa caalaa nu barsiisu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:11">ka sinbirroota caalaa nu qaroonsu eessa jira?› hin jedhu.<verse eid="JOB 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12"/>Isaan hin iyyan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">inni ammoo sababa koora worra hantuu godhuutiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:12">deebii isaaniif hin deebisu.<verse eid="JOB 35:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13"/>Dhugumaan Waaqi iyyata bu'aa hin qanne hin dhage'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">Waaqi waan mara dande'ulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:13">gara iyya isaanii hin midhatu.<verse eid="JOB 35:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14"/>Iyoob ati, ‹Ani Waaqa hin dhaggu› yennaa jettu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">inni attam iyya teeti dhage'a ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 35:14">Haajaan keeti isa dura jira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:14">isuma eegadhu.<verse eid="JOB 35:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15"/>Waaqi aarii ifiitiin ka hin adanne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:15">hammeenna namaalle itti ilaalaa ka taru seetaa?<verse eid="JOB 35:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16"/>Iyoob ati, dubbii bu'aa hin qanne dubbatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 35:16">beekkumsa maleelle dubbii fakkansita» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 35:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1"/>Eliihuun ammalle ede'ee Iyoobiin,<verse eid="JOB 36:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2"/>«Ani ammalle marroo Waaqaatiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">waan dubbadhu waan qabuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:2">diqqoo naa ossadhu.<verse eid="JOB 36:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3"/>Ani beekkumsa kiyya fagoo irraa hin fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">Waaqi na dade balchaa akka te'e</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:3">ani hin mudhisa.<verse eid="JOB 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4"/>Dhugumaan dubbiin tiyya dharaa moti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">ani nami si woliin jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:4">beekkumsa dhidhinna hin qanne akka qabu beeki.<verse eid="JOB 36:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5"/>«Dhugumaan Waaqi hunnaamessa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">Inni eennulle hin tuffatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:5">hunni hubantii isaa guddoo jaddu'u.<verse eid="JOB 36:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6"/>Inni worra hamaa jiru'uun hin leesisu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:6">worra cunqurfameef ammoo haqa isaanii hin kenna.<verse eid="JOB 36:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7"/>Inni ila ifii balchoota irraa hin kaasu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">mootota woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">barcumaa mootumma'aa irra isaan hin teessisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:7">haga bara baraalle ol ol isaan hin qaba.<verse eid="JOB 36:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8"/>Namooti wodaroo sibiilaatiin yoo hidhamane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:8">yookiin wodaroo rakkinnaatiin yoo qabamane,<verse eid="JOB 36:8"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9"/>balleessaa isaan koora ifiitiin hujane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:9">inni isaanitti hima.<verse eid="JOB 36:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10"/>Qajeelfama akka dhage'anuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">gurra isaanii hin bana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">cubbuu ifii irralle'ee akka deebi'anuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:10">isaan hin ajaja.<verse eid="JOB 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11"/>Isaan Waaqaaf ajajamanee isa yoo tajaajilane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">bara isaanii ka hafe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:11">durumma'aa fi gammadaan fixatan.<verse eid="JOB 36:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12"/>Isa dhage'uu yoo didane ammoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">shallaaga'aan hin badan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:12">Waaqa beekiisa waan didaneef hin du'an.<verse eid="JOB 36:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13"/>«Worri Waaqa malee le'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">aarii gadha'atti qabatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">yennaa inni isaan adabulle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:13">qarqaarsa dhaggatiisaaf hin daadimatanu.<verse eid="JOB 36:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14"/>Isaan dhiira Galma Waaqaa keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">wol bukkoonsitu oddu'utti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:14">ijoollumma'aanuu du'an.<verse eid="JOB 36:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15"/>Waaqi worra rakkatanu rakkoo keessaa hin baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:15">inni akka isaan rakkatanu godhaa isaan barsiisa.<verse eid="JOB 36:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16"/>«Inni ammalle farra hantuu keessaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">gara addee badhoo wol rakkisuun hin jiretti si baasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:16">qoriin teetille sagalee dansa'aan hin guutanti.<verse eid="JOB 36:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17"/>Amma ammoo muraan nama hama'aaf malte</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">waan sitti muranteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:17">adabbii si'iif malte fudhatiisatti jirta.<verse eid="JOB 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18"/>Eennulle durumma'aan akka si hin sonne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:18">Safuu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">36:18 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Safuu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malaamaltummaa jechu'u.</char></note> guddoolle'een akka hin sobanne ifi eegadhu.<verse eid="JOB 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19"/>Karri teeti yookiin jabeenni hunna teetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:19">rakkinna hamaa keessaa si baasuu dande'anii ree?<verse eid="JOB 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20"/>Ati halkan kolbaan addee ifii irraa baddu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:20">akka dhufu hin halchin.<verse eid="JOB 36:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21"/>Farriisaan irra hantuu hujiisa waan filatteef,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:21">gara hammeennaa akka hin deebine ifi eegadhu.<verse eid="JOB 36:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22"/>«Kunoo, Waaqi hunna ifiitiin ol ol jedheera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:22">barsiisaan akka isaa eennu ree?<verse eid="JOB 36:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23"/>Waan Waaqi huju eentu itti himuu dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:23">yookiin eentu, ‹Ati dokonkorteerta› isaan jedha ree?<verse eid="JOB 36:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24"/>Hujii isaa ta nami faaru'uun leellifatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:24">atille akka leellifattu yaadadhu.<verse eid="JOB 36:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25"/>Nami duudiin hujii isaa dhaggeera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:25">nami martinuu fagoo irraa daaw'ata.<verse eid="JOB 36:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26"/>Dhugumaan Waaqi gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">inni hubantii teennaan oli;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:26">laakkossi bara isaalle qorqoramuu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27"/>«Bisaan lafa irraa ol fuudhee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:27">gara copha bokkeyaa ka deebisu Waaqa.<verse eid="JOB 36:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28"/>Inni bokkeya duumensa keessaa gad hin roobisiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:28">namoota irralle'etti hin danbalaasa.<verse eid="JOB 36:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29"/>Inni attam akka duumensa diriirsu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">galma guddaa ifii keessaa attam akka mandi'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:29">eentu hubatuu dande'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 36:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30"/>Kunoo, Waaqi adaala ifiititti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">balaqqeettii attam akka bittinneessu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:30">hundee abbaaya'aalle dukkanaan akka gollu ilaali.<verse eid="JOB 36:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31"/>Inni akka kanaan gosa biyya adda addaa bulcha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:31">sagalee bacaalle isaaniif kenna.<verse eid="JOB 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32"/>Inni balaqqeettii harkatti qabatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:32">lafa itti murteessetti akka dhoottu hin ajaja.<verse eid="JOB 36:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33"/>Mandiisuun bokkeenni bubbe'ee akka dhufaaru beessitti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 36:33">horiille dhufiisa isi'ii hin beekan.<verse eid="JOB 36:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1"/>«Bokkeenni bubbe'ee sun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:1">gadhaa kiyya hollachiisee, sheephisiise.<verse eid="JOB 37:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2"/>Qoonqoo isaa ta akka mandiisu'uu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:2">gungunsuu afaan isaa keessaa baatulle caqasa'a.<verse eid="JOB 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3"/>Inni gubba'aan jala duudi'itti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:3">balaqqeettii ifii haga qaccee lafaatitti gad lakkisa.<verse eid="JOB 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4"/>Achiin duuba harqiis qoonqoo isaa hin dhage'anti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">inni qoonqoo ifii ta sodaachittu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">akka mandiisu'uu hin dhageessisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">yennaa qoonqoo ifii dhageessisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:4">balaqqeettiille duubatti hin hamburu.<verse eid="JOB 37:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5"/>Waaqi qoonqoo ifii ta bilbaasaatiin hin mandi'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:5">waan gugurdoo hubantii teennaan olii hin huja.<verse eid="JOB 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6"/>Inni dhakaa bokkeyaatiin, ‹Lafa irratti bu'i›,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:6">tiifuu bokkeyaatille'een, ‹Bokkeya jabaa te'i› hin jedha.<verse eid="JOB 37:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7"/>Nami inni dade duudiin hujii isaa beekuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:7">nami martinuu hujii ifii akka dhaabu hin godha.<verse eid="JOB 37:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8"/>Yennaa san bineensoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">gara goda ifii keessatti hin qubatan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:8">mandhee ifii keessalle'etti dhokatan.<verse eid="JOB 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9"/>Hobonbolattiin gara kibbaatii hin dhutti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:9">qilleensi boojji'ii gara kaabaatii dhufa.<verse eid="JOB 37:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10"/>Hafuurri Waaqaa dhakaa bokkeyaa fida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:10">bisaan badhaalle ititee dhakaa bokkeyaa te'a.<verse eid="JOB 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11"/>Inni duumensi akka bisaan ba'atu hin godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:11">balaqqeettii ifiille duumensa keessaa balaqqisiisa.<verse eid="JOB 37:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12"/>Duumensi waan inni ajaje muummessiisaaf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">qajeelcha isaatiin lafa duudii irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:12">asii fi achi mara.<verse eid="JOB 37:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13"/>Waaqi namoota adabiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">lafa ifii jiisiisaaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:13">yookiin jaalala ifii mudhisiisaaf bokkeya fida.<verse eid="JOB 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14"/>«Iyoob, tana dhage'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">me lakkisiitii hujii Waaqaa ta maade'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:14">yaadaan hubadhu.<verse eid="JOB 37:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15"/>Waaqi duumensa attam akka toowatu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">balaqqeettii duumensa ifiille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:15">attam akka balaqqisiisu ati hin beettaa?<verse eid="JOB 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16"/>Duumensa gubba'atti ka rarraasuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">hujii maade'ee tana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:16">ta Waaqa beekkumsa dhidhuu hin qannee hin beettaa?<verse eid="JOB 37:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17"/>Yennaa latti qilleensa gara kibbaatiin o'itee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:17">ati ka woyaan teeti keessatti fuurtu,<verse eid="JOB 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18"/>ol-gubbaa akka daaw'itii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">sageettuu baqisiifante irraa hujantee jabaattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:18">yennaa Waaqi diriirsu ati isa qarqaaruu dandeettaa?<verse eid="JOB 37:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19"/>«Waan Waaqaan jennu nutti himi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">nuuti womaa waan hin beenneef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:19">haajaa keenna dhikeeffatiisa hin dandeennu.<verse eid="JOB 37:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20"/>Akka ani dubbatu'uu jiru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:20">nami isatti himiisa barbaachisaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 37:20">Nami tana dubbatiisaaf yaadu dhuguma hin bada.<verse eid="JOB 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21"/>Qilleensi duumensa haxowee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">gubbaa irraa qulqulleesseen duuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:21">nami tokkolle aduu midhatee ilaaluu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 37:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22"/>Inni ulfinna akka worqi'ii calalaquun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">gara kaabaatiin hin dhufa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:22">Waaqi arnya sodaachisa'aan hin dhufa.<verse eid="JOB 37:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23"/>Waaqi waan mara dande'u hubantii teennaan ol;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">hunnaan gudda'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:23">inni abbaa muraa dhuga'aatille'e.<verse eid="JOB 37:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24"/>Tanaaf nami marti isa sodaata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 37:24">inni worra ifiin qaroo jedhu hin tuffata» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 37:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Deebii Mootiin Waan Maraa Iyoobiif Deebise</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1"/>Achiin duuba Mootiin Waan Maraa hobonbolattii keessaa Iyoobitti dubbatee,<verse eid="JOB 38:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2"/>«Dubbii beekkumsa malee dubbatantuun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:2">gorsa kiyya ka diqqeessu kun eennu?<verse eid="JOB 38:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3"/>Akka dhiiraa hidha keeti hidhadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:3">ani si gaafadha; atille naaf deebis.<verse eid="JOB 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4"/>«Yennaa ani hundee lafaa dhaabe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">ati eessa jirtaayyu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:4">Hubantii yoo qabaatte natti himi.<verse eid="JOB 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5"/>Haga lafaa ka murteesse eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">Isii irralle'etti sarara miki'ii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:5 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Mikii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Meeshaa miki'iititti fayyadamiisaan haga wonni tokko dheerattu yookiin badhattu beekiis.</char></note> ka diriirse</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:5">eennu akka te'e hin beettaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6"/>Hundeen lafaa maan irratti dhaabatte?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:6">Dhakaa roga isi'iille ka dhaabe eennu?<verse eid="JOB 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7"/>Yennaa urjooti ganamaa wolitti qabantee faarsitu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">ergantooti Waaqaalle yennaa ilillittu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:7">ati eessa jirtaayyu?<verse eid="JOB 38:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8"/>«Yennaa abbaayaan lafa keessaa dhoote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:8">balbala madda isi'ii ka cufe eennu ree?<verse eid="JOB 38:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9"/>Abbaayaa duumensaan uffisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:9">dukkana dimmalle'een ka isii golle ana.<verse eid="JOB 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10"/>Meessaalle itti godhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:10">balbalaa fi danqaraa ka itti keye ana.<verse eid="JOB 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11"/>‹Ati haga asii hin dhutta; asi irra hin dabartu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">Danbaliin teeti jadduun</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:11">asitti dhaabbatuu ti!› ka jedhe ana.<verse eid="JOB 38:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12"/>«Iyoob, bara jiruu teetii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">latti akka bariitu ajajjee beettaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:12">Bariin lafaalle addee akka qabattu gooteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13"/>Bari'iisi lafaa haga qaccee lafaa dhaqqabee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:13">worri hamaan akka isii irraa hargufamanu gooteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14"/>Ifi bari'ii koobotii fi dhooqoti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">akka woyaa dachaafantee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">dhaabbatanee akka mudhatanu godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">akka chaappaa faara jiidhaa irratti dhowamee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:14">guddisee mudhisa.<verse eid="JOB 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15"/>Worra hamaa ifi isaan duraa fudhatameera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:15">harki isaan hantuu hujiisaaf ol fudhatanelle cabeera.<verse eid="JOB 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16"/>«Ati gara madda abbaaya'aa gad buuteertaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:16">Yookiin hundee qilee abbaaya'aa keessa ideenteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17"/>Balbalti du'aa sitti mudhifanteerti?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:17">Yookiin balbala dukkana dimmaa dhaggiteerta?<verse eid="JOB 38:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18"/>Badhinna biyya lafaa hubatteertaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:18">Tana mara yoo beettu teete me natti himi.<verse eid="JOB 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19"/>«Karaan gara ifaa geessu meet?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:19">Addeen dukkanti jirtulle eessa?<verse eid="JOB 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20"/>Ifaa fi dukkana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">addee isaaniititti geessuu hin dandeettaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:20">Karaa gara addee isaanii geessu hin beettaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 38:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21"/>Biyyi lafaa yennaa dadante</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">ati waan dhalatteertuuf dhuguma hin beetta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:21">bara hedduulle leeteerta.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yaada laakkossa kanaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wonni as irratti jedhamuu barbaadame, biyyi lafaa yennaa dadantu ati womaa hin beettuu; bara dheeraalle leetee hin jirtu yaada jedhu.</char></note><verse eid="JOB 38:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22"/>«Ati gara mana dhakaan bokkeyaa itti kuufamu seenteertaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:22">Yookiin mana dhakaan bokkeyaa itti kuufamu dhaggiteertaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23"/>Dhakaan bokkeyaa kun,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">ka ani yennaa rakko'ootiif,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:23">guyyaa woraanaatii fi guyyaa lolaatiifiille maffadhe.<verse eid="JOB 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24"/>Karaan gara addee ifi irraa balaqqisu geessu kam?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">Yookiin qilleensi gara aduun baatuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:24">eessa irraa lafatti bittinnowa?<verse eid="JOB 38:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25"/>Bokkeya gad lola'uu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">bokkeya bubbe'ee ka mandiisu'uutiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:25">karaa ka baase eennu?<verse eid="JOB 38:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26"/>Lafa nami tokkolle hin leenetti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">goomolee nami tokkolle hin jirre keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:26">bokkeya roobisiisee,<verse eid="JOB 38:26"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27"/>lafa goomolee duwwaa jiisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:27">marra akka baattu ka godhe eennu?<verse eid="JOB 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28"/>Abbaan bokkeyaatii fi copha fixeensaa eennu ree?<verse eid="JOB 38:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29"/>Dhakaan bokkeyaa gadaamessa eennuu keessaa baye?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:29">Qorra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:29 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Qorra: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin boojjii jedhama.</char></note> ol-gubbaa irraa bu'u eentu dhale?<verse eid="JOB 38:29"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30"/>Qorri sun bisaan akka dhaka'aa jabeessee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:30">dirri abbaaya'aa akka dhakaa bokkeyaa ite'a.<verse eid="JOB 38:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31"/>«Tuuta urjootaa ka, ‹Torbii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:31 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Torbii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiikkaan gariin Piliyaadis jedhan.</char></note>› jedhamanu, wolitti hidhuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:31">yookiin wodaroo tuuta urjoota, ‹Sadee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:31 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sadee: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiikkaan gariin Ooriyoon jedhan.</char></note>› jedhamanuu hiikuu hin dandeettaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32"/>Tuuta urjoota gara kibbaa yennaa isaaniititti bobbaasuu dandeettaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:32">Tuuta urjootaa ‹Ka bineensa Doobbaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:32 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Doobbaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bineensa Iyyaa fakkaatu.</char></note>› jedhamu fakkaatu, ilmaan ijoollee isaanii woliin sooressuu dandeettaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33"/>Ati sirna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:33 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Sirna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin sirinya jedhama.</char></note> ol-gubba'aa beettaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:33">Sirni kun lafa irratti akka huju godhuu dandeettaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34"/>«Lolaan bisaanii akka si liqinsuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:34">qoonqoo ol-qabattee duumensatti dubbatuu dandeettaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35"/>Ati balaqqeettiin akka buutu erguu dandeettaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:35">Isiille si'iin, ‹Kunoo, ani as jira› hin jettii?<verse eid="JOB 38:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36"/>Kormi lukku'uu bari'iisa lafaa beekee akka iyyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">yookiin sinbirreen akka mana ijaarrattu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:36">ka qarummaa kenneef eennu?<verse eid="JOB 38:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37-38"/>Yennaa bukuun lafaa jabaattee wolitti tuulantuu fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37-38">quqquuqaan lafaa wolitti qabatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37-38">duumensa laakkowiisaaf ka qarummaa qabu eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37-38">Waabaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38:37-38 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Waabaa bisaanii: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin okkotee bisaanii guddittii jedhamuu dande'a.</char></note> bisaanii ta ol-gubba'aa jissee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:37-38">ka bisaan gad naquu dande'u eennu?<verse eid="JOB 38:37-38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39"/>«Ati neenqa dhala'aaf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">waan nyaatu hin adansitaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:39">Yookiin dardaroota neenqaa hin quussitaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 38:39"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40"/>Yennaa isaan mandhee ifii keessatti riphanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">yookiin daggala keessatti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">dhokatanee yennaa gaadatanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:40">isaan hin quussitaa?<verse eid="JOB 38:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41"/>Yennaa ilmeen harraaqessaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">waan nyaattu dhaddee daaxxu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">gara Waaqaalle yennaa boottu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 38:41">ka sagalee isi'iif kennu eennu?<verse eid="JOB 38:41"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1"/>«Yennaa godaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:1 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Godaan gaaraa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bineensa re'ee fakkaatu ka gaara irra le'u.</char></note> gaaraa dhalu beettaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:1">Gadansi dhaluun dhaggitee beettaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2"/>Ji'a meeqa rimeyaan turanee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:2">yoom akka dhalanu hin beettaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3"/>Isaan quphananee dhalan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:3">foolata ifii irralle'ee hin furatan.<verse eid="JOB 39:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4"/>Ilmeen isaanii baddaa keessatti guddattee jabaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">bayanee deemaneen duuba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:4">gara haadha ifii hin deebi'anu.<verse eid="JOB 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5"/>«Harreen diidaa gara feete akka deentu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">ka lakkise eennu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:5">Hidhaana irraa ka isii hiike eennu?<verse eid="JOB 39:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6"/>Ani lafa goomole'ee mana isaanii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">dirree sooddaalle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:6">addee isaan le'anu godhee kenneef.<verse eid="JOB 39:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7"/>Isaan qachaa hoga'aa irraa fagaatanee le'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:7">nami isaan leenjisee hujisiisulle hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8"/>Isaan dheedaaf gaarotatti bobba'an;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:8">waan magariisa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:8 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Magariisa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin kushaankusha.</char></note> mara barbaadatan.<verse eid="JOB 39:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9"/>«Gafarsi si tajaajiliisaaf fedhii hin qabaataa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:9">Moonaa teeti keessalle hin bulaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10"/>Gafarsa waanjoo itti hiitee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:10">moofara harkisaa akka qotu godhuu dandeettaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11"/>Jabeenni isaa guddaa waan te'eef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">isatti hin addattaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:11">Hujii teeti ulfaattuu isatti hin lakkittaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12"/>Inni midhaan keeti wolitti qabee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:12">gara eeddummee teetii akka si'iif fidu hin addattaa?<verse eid="JOB 39:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13"/>«Guchiin gammadaan koola ifii hargufatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:13">koollii isi'ii ammoo akka koola qonga'aatii moti.<verse eid="JOB 39:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14"/>Guchiin quuphaa ifii lafatti buutti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:14">biyyeen akka itti o'ituufille achumatti lakkitti.<verse eid="JOB 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15"/>Isiin miilli akka caccassu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:15">bineensotille akka irra ijjatanu hin yaadattu.<verse eid="JOB 39:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16"/>Akka waan ta isi'ii hin te'inii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">cuucuu ifiititti gadhaa jabaatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:16">eloon isi'ii baddulle hin qortu.<verse eid="JOB 39:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17"/>Ka qarummaa isii dhoogge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:17">ka hubantiille isi'iif hin kennin ana Waaqa.<verse eid="JOB 39:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18"/>Yennaa rukkisiisa jalqaddu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:18">fardaa fi abbaa fardaatitti hin kolliti.<verse eid="JOB 39:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19"/>«Iyoob, fardaaf jabeenna ka kenne si'ii?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">Yookiin morma isaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:19">gama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">39:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Gama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gami rifeensa dheeraa lumma fardaa irratti latu.</char></note> dhedheeraa ka uffise si'ii?<verse eid="JOB 39:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20"/>Akka korophiisaa kuruphisaa fooqqisaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:20">akka inni nama bararassu ka godhu si'ii?<verse eid="JOB 39:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21"/>Fardi jabeenna ifiititti addatiisaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">kotte'een lafa qotaa himimmisee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:21">loliisaaf hin baya.<verse eid="JOB 39:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22"/>Inni soda'atti kolla; womaa hin sodaatu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:22">shallaagaa irralle'ee duubatti hin deebi'u.<verse eid="JOB 39:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23"/>Eboon balaqqittuu fi marcaan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">subba daayaa woliin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:23">cinaacha isaatitti bubbu'ee qilillisa.<verse eid="JOB 39:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24"/>Fardi hollatee worraaqatee xinniqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:24">yennaa tultullaan afuufamu hin sawwaanata.<verse eid="JOB 39:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25"/>Inni yennaa tultullaan afuufamu hin fooqqisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">dhaadata abbootii duulaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:25">hoga'aa fi lola fago'ottuu foolee fuudha.<verse eid="JOB 39:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26"/>«Cululleen qarummaa teetiin koolaan kaatee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:26">gara kibbaatitti koola ifii badhifattii?<verse eid="JOB 39:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27"/>Risaan ajaja keetiin gubbaa irra ka'aa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">Allaattiin ajaja keetiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:27">mana ifii gaara irratti ijaarrattii?<verse eid="JOB 39:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28"/>Isiin rassaa ol ka'e irra le'aa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">achitti mana ijaarratti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:28">rassaan sun kushee isi'ii ti.<verse eid="JOB 39:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29"/>Isiin achi jiraattee waan nyaattu dooyatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:29">ilti isi'iille fago'otti waan gaadattu dhaggiti.<verse eid="JOB 39:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30"/>Ilmeen isi'ii dhiiga xuuxatti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 39:30">isiille addee raqi jirutti dhagganti» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 39:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1"/>Ammalle Mootiin Waan Maraa Iyoobiin,<verse eid="JOB 40:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2"/>«Nami ana Waaqa waan mara dande'u morkee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">hin sirreessaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:2">Ka Waaqa moromu deebii kennuu ti» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 40:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyoob</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob deebisee Mootii Waan Maraatiin,<verse eid="JOB 40:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4"/>«Kunoo ani nami woy hin baane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">afaan kiyya qabatiisa malee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:4">maan si'iif deebisa ree?<verse eid="JOB 40:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5"/>Ani takkaa dubbadheera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">waan deebisu hin qabu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">lammeessoolle dubbadheera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:5">haganaa achi itti hin dabalu» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 40:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6"/>Achiin duuba Mootiin Waan Maraa hobonbolattii keessaa Iyoobitti dubbatee,<verse eid="JOB 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7"/>«Akka dhiiraa hidha keeti hidhadhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">ani si gaafadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:7">atille naaf deebis.<verse eid="JOB 40:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8"/>«Ati anaayyuu dokonkora keessa galchitaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:8">Ati balchaa ifi godhiisaaf yakkaa natti murtaa?<verse eid="JOB 40:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9"/>Ati hunna akka hunna tiyyaa qaddaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:9">Qoonqoon teetille akka qoonqoo tiyyaa hin mandiitii?<verse eid="JOB 40:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10"/>Arnyaa fi guddinnaan ifi kuuladhu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:10">ulfinnaa fi fudhatama dhaggatiisa uffadhu.<verse eid="JOB 40:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11"/>Worra kooru ilaaliitii qaanessi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:11">aarii teetille isaan irratti dhangalaas.<verse eid="JOB 40:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12"/>Worra kooru duudii gad qabi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:12">worra hamoota lafa isaan dhaabbatanetti butuchi.<verse eid="JOB 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13"/>Fuula isaan mariitii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">biyya lafaa ta jalaatitti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:13">mara isaaniituu wolumatti awwaali.<verse eid="JOB 40:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14"/>Achiin duuba akka ati hunnuma teetiin injifattu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:14">anille dhugaa si'iif hin baya.<verse eid="JOB 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15"/>«Roophii ta ani akkuma si dade, isiille dade ilaali;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:15">isiin akkuma qotiyyo'oo marra dheeddi.<verse eid="JOB 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16"/>Jabeenni isi'ii hidha isi'ii keessa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:16">hunni isi'ii morgeya gadhaa isi'ii keessa jirti.<verse eid="JOB 40:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17"/>Eegeen isi'ii akka hindheensaa sooti'i;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:17">morgey miila isi'iille jaba'a.<verse eid="JOB 40:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18"/>Lafeen isi'ii akka uujjummee sageettu'uu ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:18">harkii fi miilli isi'ii akka ulee sibiilaa ti.<verse eid="JOB 40:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19"/>Isiin dada ani dade duudii keessaa ta qaraa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:19 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ta qaraa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">jechuun kun yennaa yookiin barbaachisummaa yookiin guddinna isi'ii ilaaluu dande'a.</char></note> ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:19">ana malee ka isii injifatu hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 40:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20"/>Gaaroti bineensoti duudiin irra burraaqanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:20">marra isiin dheeddu baasaniif.<verse eid="JOB 40:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21"/>Isiin haxanxarii qore'ee<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Haxanxarii qore'ee: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin hammarroo jedhamuu dande'a.</char></note> jala ciittee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">caffaa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:21 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Caffaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yookiin raaroo dhoqqe'ee.</char></note> keessa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:21">odduu alladdu'uutitti dhokatti.<verse eid="JOB 40:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22"/>Haxanxariin qore'ee gaaddisa ifiitiin isii golliti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:22">muki olaati'iille isii hin marsa.<verse eid="JOB 40:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23"/>Yennaa lagi guutee danbala'u hin sodaattu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:23">lagi Yordaanosii guutulle hin rifattu.<verse eid="JOB 40:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24"/>Eennulle adoo ilti roophi'ii dhaggituu isii qabuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 40:24">yookiin malxaqqo'oon funnaan isi'ii uruu dande'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 40:24"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1"/>«Ati bineensa naacha fakkaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">ka ‹Lewaataan› jedhamu malxaqqo'oon qabuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">yookiin arraba isaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:1">wodaro'oon hidhuu hin dandeettaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2"/>Wodaroo funnaan isaa keessa baasuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">yookiin a'oo isaa malxaqqo'oon woraanuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:2">hin dandeettaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3"/>Inni akka ati isaaf marartu si hin kadhatta ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:3">Dubbii laattuulle'een sitti hin dubbataa ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4"/>Haga bara baraa akka ati garba isa godhattuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:4">wolii galtee si woliin hin godhataa ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5"/>Akka sinbirree mana barattee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">isa woliin taphatuu hin dandeettaa ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">Yookiin tapha ijoollee durraa teetiitiif</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:5">isa hin hiitaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6"/>Daldaltooti qurxummi'ii gatii isaa irratti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">wol hin falmanii ree?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:6">Kukkutaneelle hin qoodatanii ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7"/>Gogaa isaa ebo'oon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">mataa isaalle marcaa qurxummi'iitiin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:7">uriisa hin dandeettaa ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8"/>Harka keetiin yoo isa tuxxe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">lola san hin qaabatta;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:8">ijjumaalle itti hin deebitu.<verse eid="JOB 41:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9"/>Bineensa san lolanee injifatiisaaf wodhaaniis</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">toluma elowiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:9">nami isa dhaggu sheephisee jiga.<verse eid="JOB 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10"/>Isa kakkaasiisaaf ka itti guulu eega hin jirre teete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:10">eentu na dura dhaabbatiisa dande'a ree?<verse eid="JOB 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11"/>Wonni ol-gubba'aan jala jirtu marti tiyya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">akka ani isaaf deebisee kaffalu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:11">waan tokkolle ka anaa kenneeru hin jiru.<verse eid="JOB 41:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12"/>«Ani marroo harkaa fi miila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">yookiin jabeenna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">yookiin miidhaginna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">dhaaba nafa bineensa naacha fakkaatu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">ka ‹Lewaataan› jedhamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:12">dubbadhu malee hin cadhisu.<verse eid="JOB 41:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13"/>Gogaa nafa isaa ka dachaa te'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">eentu isa irraa quncisuu dande'a?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:13">Eentu bixaalaan isatti dhikaatuu dande'a?<verse eid="JOB 41:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14"/>Balbala afaan isaa ka ilkaan sodaachisu itti naannowe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:14">eentu banuu dande'a?<verse eid="JOB 41:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15"/>Inni dudda jabaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:15">akka wontee tarree galtee wolitti maxxanfantee qaba.<verse eid="JOB 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16"/>Tokko tokkoon wontee sanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">wol wolitti guddoo waan dhikaataneeranuuf</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:16">qilleensi wodhakkaa isaanii dabaruu hin dande'u.<verse eid="JOB 41:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17"/>Isaan wol wolitti waan maxxananeeranuuf,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:17">wol irraa gargar bayuu hin dande'anu.<verse eid="JOB 41:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18"/>Yennaa inni haxxifatu ifi hin balaqqisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:18">ilti isaa akka boruu dayya'uu ti.<verse eid="JOB 41:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19"/>Afaan isaa keessaa bobe'a ibiddaatitti baya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:19">qaanqeen ibiddaalle afaan isaa keessaa xoxxi.<verse eid="JOB 41:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20"/>Akkuma aarri okkotee ibidda o'aa irra jirtu keessaa aaru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:20">aarri funnaan isaa keessaa baya.<verse eid="JOB 41:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21"/>Hafuurri isaa cilee qassiisa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:21">bobeenni ibiddaalle afaan isaa keessaa baya.<verse eid="JOB 41:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22"/>Jabeenni lumma isaa keessa jira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:22">ka isaan wolde'u marti hin bararaqa.<verse eid="JOB 41:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23"/>Dachaan foon isaa wolitti maxxaneera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:23">dachaan foon isaa jaba'a; hin tacho'ulle'e.<verse eid="JOB 41:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24"/>Gadhaan isaa akka dhaka'aa jaba'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:24">akka daaku'uulle jaba'a.<verse eid="JOB 41:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25"/>Yennaa inni ka'u</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">worri hunnaameyyiin hin bararaqa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:25">yennaa inni tacho'ulle gara duubaa deebi'an.<verse eid="JOB 41:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26"/>Shallaagaan, eboon, guube'ee fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">mey woraanaa dhibiille</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:26">isa hin miidhanu.<verse eid="JOB 41:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27"/>Inni sibiila akka huuraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:27">sageettuu akka muka hurroyee bulleessa.<verse eid="JOB 41:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28"/>Daayi isa hin ari'u;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:28">dhakaan looyya'aa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:28 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Looyyaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yaadannoo 1 Sam. 17:40 irratti kenname ilaali.</char></note> isaaf akka hicaace'ee ti.<verse eid="JOB 41:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29"/>Ciiraan isaaf akka hicaace'ee ti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:29">yennaa nami marcaa isatti darbatu hin kolla.<verse eid="JOB 41:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30"/>Gogaan gadhaa isaa jalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">akka bassoo qara qadduu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">yennaa inni mirmiqu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:30">dhoqqee irratti beessisa godha.<verse eid="JOB 41:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31"/>Inni qilee abbaaya'aa, akka keloo danfituu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:31">abbaayaalle akka keloo zayiti'ii hin burqisiisa.<verse eid="JOB 41:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32"/>Inni karaa irra dabare akka ifu hin godha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:32">abbaayaalle hin hoomachessa.<verse eid="JOB 41:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33"/>Biyya lafaa irra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">dadi woy hin sodaanne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:33">ta akka isaa hin jirtu.<verse eid="JOB 41:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34"/>Inni bineensota gugurdaa maraayyuu hin tuffata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 41:34">inni bineensota gugurdaa mara irratti mooti'i» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 41:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1"/>Achiin duuba Iyoob Mootii Waan Maraatiif deebisee,<verse eid="JOB 42:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2"/>«Ati waan mara godhuu akka dandeettu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">karoora keetille ka gufachiisu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:2">akka hin jirre ani hin beeka.<verse eid="JOB 42:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3"/>Ati, ‹Beekkumsa malee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">karoora kiyya ka dhossu eennu?› jetteerta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JOB 42:3">Dhugumaan ani waan hin hubatin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:3">waan beekiisaaf guddoo maadee natti teete dubbadheera.<verse eid="JOB 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4"/>«Ati, ‹Na caqasi; ani hin dubbadha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">ani si gaafadha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:4">atille naaf deebis› jetteerta.<verse eid="JOB 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5"/>Ani marroo teeti dur gurra qofaan dhage'e;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:5">amma ammoo iluma tiyyaan si dhagge.<verse eid="JOB 42:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6"/>Tanaaf ani waan dubbadhetti fokkifadhee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">buku'uu fi daadhaa irra te'ee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JOB 42:6">cubbuu tiyya irraa deebi'a» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yaada Buufataa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa waan kana Iyoob woliin dubbateen duuba, Eliifaazii nama qachaa Temaaniitiif deebisee, «Isin akka tajaajilaa kiyya Iyoobii waan sirrii te'e waan hin dubbatiniif aariin tiyya si'ii fi jaalota teeti lamaan irratti bobeeteerti. <verse eid="JOB 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8"/>Tanaaf amma korommii torbaa fi korbeeyyii hoole'ee torba fuudha'aatii, gara tajaajilaa kiyya Iyoobii dhaqa'a; achitti kennansa gubamu marroo cubbuu teessaniitiif dhikeeffadha'a; inni isiniif hin daadimata; anille daadimata isaa waan dhage'uuf, akka hujii fokkisiittuu teessaniititti isinitti hin muru; isin akka tajaajilaa kiyya Iyoobii, marroo tiyyaaf waan sirrii te'e hin dubbanne» jedhe.<verse eid="JOB 42:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9"/>Achiin duuba Eliifaaziin nami qachaa Temaanii, Biildaad nami biyya Shu'aatii fi Zofaar nami biyya Naa'imaa dhaqanee, akkuma Mootiin Waan Maraa isaan ajaje godhane; Mootiin Waan Maraalle daadimata Iyoobii dhage'e.<verse eid="JOB 42:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10"/>Iyoob jaalota ifii sadiif daadimateen duuba, Mootiin Waan Maraa karra isaa addee duriititti deebisee, ta dur qabu caalaa dachaa lama kenneef. <verse eid="JOB 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11"/>Achiin duuba obboleeyyan Iyoobii ta dhiiraatii fi ta durraa, worri dur isa beeku duudiille gara isaa dhufanee, mana isaatitti isa woliin areerratane; isaan rakkoo guddoo Mootiin Waan Maraa isatti fide maraaf gaddanee, isa jajjabeessane; tokko tokkoon isaaniituu beesee diqqo'oo fi qubee worqi'ii kennaneef.<verse eid="JOB 42:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12"/>Mootiin Waan Maraa jiruu Iyoobii ta durii caalaa ta duuba irraa eebbise; Iyoob hoolee kuma kudhanii afur, gaala kuma jaa, qotiyyoo ximmaadii kuma tokkoo fi harree kuma tokko qabaayyu. <verse eid="JOB 42:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13"/>Inni ammalle ilmaan torbaa fi durra sad uumate. <verse eid="JOB 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14"/>Inni intala ifii angafittii, «Yimiimaa» ta lammeesso'oo, «Qasi'aa» ta sadeesso'oo, «Qereen-haphuu» jedhee maqaa baase. <verse eid="JOB 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15"/>Lafa duudii irratti dubartiin akka durra Iyoobii guddoo miidhaddu hin jirtuuyyu; abbaan isaanii Iyoob obboleeyyan isaanii woliin dhaala isaaniif qoode.<verse eid="JOB 42:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16"/>Tanaan duuba Iyoob woggaa dhibba tokkoo fi afurtama le'ee, ilmaan ifii, akaakota ifii, abuubotaa fi abutturoota ifii dhagge. <verse eid="JOB 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17"/>Inni woggaa hedduu le'ee, dulloomee du'e.<verse eid="JOB 42:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42"/>
</usx>
